		<target><![CDATA[Ocultar o catálogo]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Enable users to share the view of the catalog together with all the filters applied directly from this page, by showing the corresponding button in the top right corner." extradata="CoursecatalogApp">
		<source><![CDATA[Enable users to copy the page URL to share the link of their filtered catalogs directly from this page, by showing the corresponding button in the page top right corner.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Permite aos usuarios copiar o URL da páxina para compartir a ligazón dos seus catálogos filtrados directamente desde esta páxina, mostrando o botón correspondente na esquina superior dereita da páxina.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
