	<trans-unit id="A new channel and a new page have been created in your platform to manage the areas of interest of your users. Set the channel visibility, activate it and let your users take advantage of content coming from the web to build their knowledge in their areas of interest." extradata="admin">
		<source><![CDATA[A new channel and a new page have been created in your platform to manage the skills of your users. Set the channel visibility, activate it and let your users take advantage of content coming from the web to build their knowledge to satisfy their upskilling needs.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Creouse unha nova canle e unha nova páxina na túa plataforma para xestionar as habilidades dos teus usuarios. Establece a visibilidade da canle, actívaa e permite que os teus usuarios aproveiten o contido da web para construír o seu coñecemento para satisfacer as súas necesidades de perfeccionamento.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
