	<trans-unit id="The learner can view the hidden courses and/or learning plans again using the &quot;Hidden Items&quot; filters." extradata="admin">
		<source><![CDATA[Users can view the hidden courses and/or learning plans again using the &quot;Hidden items&quot; filters. Users are able to hide completed courses and/or learning plans (even if enrolled by the Superadmin or the Power User).]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios poden ver os cursos e/ou os plans de aprendizaxe ocultos de novo usando os &quot;Elementos ocultos&quot; filtros. Os usuarios poden ocultar cursos e/ou plans de aprendizaxe completados (aínda que estean inscritos polo superadministrador ou polo usuario avanzado).]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="The platform Artificial Intelligence analyzes the learning content (formal and informal), identifies the key phrases and automatically creates tags out of them" extradata="admin">
		<source><![CDATA[The platform artificial intelligence analyzes the learning content (formal and informal), identifies the key phrases and automatically creates tags out of them]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[A plataforma de intelixencia artificial analiza o contido da aprendizaxe (formal e informal), identifica as frases clave e crea automaticamente etiquetas a partir delas.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
