	<trans-unit id="This whitelist defines URLs that can be used while inserting an &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.w3schools.com/tags/tag_iframe.asp&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IFRAME&lt;/a&gt; in a HTML type learning object, in order to prevent security attacks." extradata="admin">
