	<trans-unit id="Use this area to list the words that you don't want to appear in tags auto-generated by Artificial Intelligence.&lt;br /&gt;Please note that Docebo AI is already using the profanity filter. Also remember that the deny list is retroactive and that it doesn't work on the user manual tagging." extradata="admin">
		<source><![CDATA[Use this area to list the words that you don't want to appear in tags auto-generated by artificial intelligence.&lt;br /&gt;Please note that Docebo AI is already using the profanity filter. Also remember that the deny list is retroactive and that it doesn't work on the user manual tagging.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Usa esta área para enumerar as palabras que non queres que aparezan nas etiquetas xeradas automaticamente pola intelixencia artificial.&lt;br /&gt;Ten en conta que Docebo AI xa está a usar o filtro de blasfemias. Lembra tamén que a lista de denegación é retroactiva e que non funciona na etiquetaxe manual do usuario.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Use this area to list the words that you want to be blocked by the user manual tagging and the AI auto-tagging functionality, so that they will not be published in the asset area.&lt;br /&gt;Please note that Docebo AI is already using the Profanity filter, and the Blacklist is retroactive." extradata="admin">
		<source><![CDATA[Use this area to list the words that you want to be blocked by the user manual tagging and the AI auto-tagging functionality, so that they will not be published in the asset area.&lt;br /&gt;Please note that Docebo AI is already using the Profanity filter, and the deny list is retroactive.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Usa esta área para enumerar as palabras que queres que se bloqueen mediante a etiquetaxe manual do usuario e a funcionalidade de etiquetado automático da IA, para que non se publiquen na área de activos.&lt;br /&gt;Ten en conta que Docebo AI xa está a usar o filtro de blasfemias e que a lista de rexeitamento é retroactiva.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
