	<trans-unit id="You can still use our legacy authentication method. However, we strongly recommend that you update your clients to OAuth2, as this method is going to be dismissed in future releases." extradata="app">
		<source><![CDATA[You can still use our legacy authentication method. However, we strongly recommend that you update your clients to OAuth2, as the current method is going to be dismissed in future releases.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Aínda podes usar o noso método de autenticación herdado. Non obstante, recomendámosche encarecidamente que actualices os teus clientes a OAuth2, xa que o método actual se descartará en próximas versións.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
