	<trans-unit id="custom_domain" extradata="app">
		<source><![CDATA[Custom domain]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Dominio personalizado]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="custom_domain_ed" extradata="app">
		<source><![CDATA[This app lets you customize the domain of your Docebo e-learning platform  (i.e.http://subdomain.yourcompany.com or http://www.yourcompany.com). In order to set-up the redirection, you have to log-into your internet service provider control panel.

For a http://subdomain.yourcompany.com domain, you have to configure the Cname parameter. For a http://www.yourcompany.com domain download the manual and follow the redirecting procedures.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Esta aplicación permíteche personalizar o dominio da túa plataforma de aprendizaxe electrónica Docebo (é dicir, http://subdomain.yourcompany.com ou http://www.yourcompany.com). Para configurar a redirección, tes que iniciar sesión no panel de control do teu fornecedor de servizos de Internet.

Para un dominio http://subdomain.yourcompany.com, ten que configurar o parámetro Cname. Para un dominio http://www.yourcompany.com descarga o manual e siga os procedementos de redirección.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="custom_domain_sd" extradata="app">
		<source><![CDATA[This app lets you customize the domain of your Docebo e-learning platform  (i.e. http://subdomain.yourcompany.com or http://www.yourcompany.com).]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Esta aplicación permíteche personalizar o dominio da túa plataforma de aprendizaxe electrónica Docebo (é dicir, http://subdomain.yourcompany.com ou http://www.yourcompany.com).]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="ecommerce" extradata="app">
		<source><![CDATA[E-commerce]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Comercio electrónico]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="ecommerce_ed" extradata="app">
		<source><![CDATA[Selling your online courses has never been that easy, thanks to the capabilities of our dedicated E-commerce app. Right after activating it, you will be able to market your courses, via your own custom catalog of courses. Your customers will be able to browse through your course catalog, and simply pay for each course via credit card. You will be collecting 100% of your net sales price directly in your PayPal for Business account.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Vender os teus cursos en liña nunca foi tan sinxelo, grazas ás capacidades da nosa aplicación de comercio electrónico dedicada. Logo de activalo, poderás comercializar os teus cursos a través do teu propio catálogo personalizado de cursos. Os teus clientes poderán navegar polo seu catálogo de cursos e simplemente pagar por cada curso con tarxeta de crédito. Recadarás o 100 % do prezo de venda neto directamente na túa conta de PayPal for Business.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="ecommerce_sd" extradata="app">
		<source><![CDATA[Market your online courses to your customers with our dedicated E-commerce app]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Comercializa os teus cursos en liña aos teus clientes coa nosa aplicación de comercio electrónico dedicada]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
