	<trans-unit id="Encourage and empower your employees with user generated content from daily on-the-job activities. With Docebo Share, content is uploaded, then categorized and peer-reviewed, curated and validated, while building a culture that recognizes and rewards top" extradata="app7020">
		<source><![CDATA[Encourage and empower your employees with user generated content from daily on-the-job activities. With Docebo Share, content is uploaded, then categorized and peer-reviewed, curated and validated, while building a culture that recognizes and rewards top.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Anima e capacita aos teus empregados con contido xerado por usuarios a partir das actividades diarias no traballo. Con Docebo Share, o contido cárgase, logo categorízase e revisase por pares, comisariado e validado, ao tempo que se constrúe unha cultura que recoñeza e recompense aos mellores.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Encourage and empower your employees with user generated content from daily on-the-job activities. With Docebo Share, content is uploaded, then categorized and peer-reviewed, curated and validated, while building a culture that recognizes and rewards top " extradata="app7020">
		<source><![CDATA[Encourage and empower your employees with user generated content from daily on-the-job activities. With Docebo Share, content is uploaded, categorized, peer-reviewed, curated, and validated, while building a culture that recognizes and rewards top performers.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Anima e capacita aos teus empregados con contido xerado por usuarios a partir das actividades diarias no traballo. Con Docebo Share, o contido é cargado, categorizado, revisado por pares, comisariado e validado, ao tempo que se constrúe unha cultura que recoñeza e recompense aos mellores.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
