	<trans-unit id="These are your ignored assets. You won't be notified for any change that happens.You can re-enable notifications or, if no action is taken,they will be automatically removed from here as soon as &lt;strong&gt;the assets are published." extradata="app7020">
		<source><![CDATA[These are your ignored assets. &lt;strong&gt;You won't be notified for any change that happens.&lt;/strong&gt; You can &lt;strong&gt;re-enable notifications&lt;/strong&gt; or, if no action is taken, they will be automatically removed from here as soon as &lt;strong&gt;the assets are published.&lt;/strong&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Estes son os teus activos ignorados. &lt;strong&gt;Non se lle notificará ningún cambio que se produza.&lt;/strong&gt; Podes &lt;strong&gt;reactivar as notificacións&lt;/strong&gt; ou, se non se realiza ningunha acción, eliminaranse automaticamente de aquí en canto &lt;strong&gt;os recursos sexan publicados.&lt;/strong&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="These are your ignored questions with requests. You won't be notified for any change that happens. You can re-enable notifications or, if no action is taken, they will be automatically removed from here as soon as the request is satisfied" extradata="app7020">
		<source><![CDATA[These are your ignored questions with requests. &lt;strong&gt;You won't be notified for any change that happens.&lt;/strong&gt; You can &lt;strong&gt;re-enable notifications&lt;/strong&gt; or, if no action is taken, they will be automatically removed from here as soon as &lt;strong&gt;the request is satisfied&lt;/strong&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Estas son as túas preguntas ignoradas con solicitudes. &lt;strong&gt;Non se lle notificará ningún cambio que se produza.&lt;/strong&gt; Podes &lt;strong&gt;reactivar as notificacións&lt;/strong&gt; ou, se non se realiza ningunha acción, eliminaranse automaticamente de aquí en canto &lt;strong&gt;se satisfaga a solicitude&lt;/strong&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="These are your silenced assets. You won't be notified for any change that happens. You can re-enable notifications or, if no action is taken, &lt;strong&gt;they will be automatically removed from here as soon as a best answer is choosen. Alternatively, you can" extradata="app7020">
		<source><![CDATA[These are your silenced assets. You won't be notified for any change that happens. You can re-enable notifications or, if no action is taken, they will be automatically removed from here as soon as a best answer is chosen. Alternatively, you can manually clean the silenced list.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Estes son os teus activos silenciados. Non se che notificará ningún cambio que se produza. Podes volver activar as notificacións ou, se non se realiza ningunha acción, eliminaranse automaticamente de aquí en canto se escolla a mellor resposta. Alternativamente, pode limpar manualmente a lista silenciada.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="These are your silenced questions. You won't be notified for any change that happens. You can re-enable notifications or, if no action is taken, they will be automatically removed from here as soon as a best answer is choosen. Alternatively, you can manua" extradata="app7020">
		<source><![CDATA[These are your silenced questions. You won't be notified for any change that happens. You can re-enable notifications or, if no action is taken, &lt;strong&gt;they will be automatically removed from here as soon as a best answer is chosen. Alternatively, you can manually clean the silenced list.&lt;/strong&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Estas son as túas preguntas silenciadas. Non se che notificará ningún cambio que se produza. Podes volver activar as notificacións ou, se non se realiza ningunha acción, &lt;strong&gt;eliminaranse automaticamente de aquí en canto se escolla a mellor resposta. Alternativamente, pode limpar manualmente a lista silenciada.&lt;/strong&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
