	<trans-unit id="When enabled, users can share links that the system cannot validate at the time of sharing. These links will be accepted without metadata, and users will need to enter the details manually." extradata="app7020">
		<source><![CDATA[When enabled, users can share links that the system cannot validate at the time of sharing. These links will be accepted without metadata, and users will need to enter the details manually.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando está activado, os usuarios poden compartir ligazóns que o sistema non pode validar no momento de compartir. Estas ligazóns aceptaranse sen metadatos e os usuarios terán que introducir os detalles manualmente.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When this option is disabled, users creating new playlists will not be allowed to publish them in channels, but only to invite people to watch them" extradata="app7020">
		<source><![CDATA[When this option is disabled, users creating new playlists will not be allowed to publish them in channels, but only to invite people to watch them]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando esta opción está desactivada, os usuarios que crean novas listas de reprodución non poderán publicalas nas canles, senón só invitar a xente a que as vexa.]]></target>
