	<trans-unit id="Much in the same way big data has changed how departments like marketing and design make decisions, the information you collect on past and present employees can be used to make beneficial changes to company rules, policies and procedures." extradata="bamboohr">
		<source><![CDATA[Much in the same way big data has changed how departments like marketing and design make decisions, the information you collect on past and present employees can be used to make beneficial changes to company rules, policies and procedures.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Do mesmo xeito que os big data cambiaron a forma en que departamentos como o marketing e o deseño toman decisións, a información que recompila sobre os empregados pasados ​​e actuais pódese usar para facer cambios beneficiosos nas regras, políticas e procedementos da empresa.]]></target>
