	<trans-unit id="NOTICE ON IMAGES: Due to a limitation of the PDF class, background images ONLY allow for uploaded files. Embedded images in the HTML code inside tags are not supported. Moreover, generic images (icons, logos, etc.) embedded in the source code do not allow for external URLs. Please upload a local file to add an image to your template." extradata="certificate">
		<source><![CDATA[Notice on images: Due to a limitation of the PDF class, background images only allow for uploaded files. Embedded images in the HTML code inside tags are not supported. Moreover, generic images (icons, logos, etc.) embedded in the source code do not allow for external URLs. Please upload a local file to add an image to your template.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Aviso sobre imaxes: debido a unha limitación da clase PDF, as imaxes de fondo só permiten ficheiros cargados. Non se admiten imaxes incrustadas no código HTML dentro das etiquetas. Ademais, as imaxes xenéricas (iconas, logotipos, etc.) incrustadas no código fonte non permiten URL externos. Carga un ficheiro local para engadir unha imaxe ao teu modelo.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
