	<trans-unit id="Set when learners can start recertifying. The renewal is automatically triggered once learners meet the required dates according to the settings in this area. Enrollments are archived and learners are re-enrolled with training material reset." extradata="certification">
		<source><![CDATA[Set when learners can start recertifying. The renewal is automatically triggered once learners meet the required dates according to the settings in this area. Enrollments are archived and learners are re-enrolled with training material reset.]]></source>
