	<trans-unit id="When a user is directly unenrolled from a learning plan, their associated awards will disappear. If the user is enrolled in the learning plan again at a later time, their progress will restart from the beginning." extradata="certification">
		<source><![CDATA[When a user is directly unenrolled from a learning plan, their associated awards will disappear. If the user is enrolled in the learning plan again at a later time, their progress will restart from the beginning.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando un usuario se cancela directamente da inscrición dun plan de aprendizaxe, os premios asociados desaparecerán. Se o usuario se inscribe de novo no plan de aprendizaxe nun momento posterior, o seu progreso reiniciarase desde o principio.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When you unenroll a learner from a certification program, they will lose their certification. If you re-enroll the learner in the same program, they will need to earn the certification again." extradata="certification">
