	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="&lt;span id=&quot;additional_iframe_info&quot; class=&quot;text-left&quot;&gt;If you're planning to &lt;strong&gt;insert an IFRAME&lt;/strong&gt; into the learning object, you must whitelist the URL(s) to display in the &lt;br /&gt;Admin &gt; Advanced Settings area, to prevent securiry attacks." extradata="course">
		<source><![CDATA[&lt;span id=&quot;additional_iframe_info&quot; class=&quot;text-left&quot;&gt;If you're planning to &lt;strong&gt;insert an iframe&lt;/strong&gt; into the training material, you must place the URLs on an allow list, in order for them to display properly by going to the &lt;br /&gt;Admin &gt; Advanced settings area (to prevent security attacks).]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[&lt;span id=&quot;información_adicional_iframe&quot; class=&quot;text-left&quot;&gt;Se planea &lt;strong&gt;inserir un iframe&lt;/strong&gt; no material de adestramento, debes colocar os URL nunha lista de permisos, para que se mostren correctamente indo á páxina de &lt;br /&gt;Administrador &gt; Área de configuración avanzada (para evitar ataques de seguridade).]]></target>
