	<trans-unit id="When learners complete a training material, they are automatically moved to the next one. If a material is set as an end object marker, the course is marked as completed, but learners still continue through the remaining materials." extradata="course">
		<source><![CDATA[When learners complete a training material, they are automatically moved to the next one. If a material is set as an end object marker, the course is marked as completed, but learners still continue through the remaining materials.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando os alumnos completan un material de formación, móvense automaticamente ao seguinte. Se se establece un material como marcador de obxecto final, o curso márcase como rematado, pero os alumnos continúan co resto dos materiais.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="With continuous improvements being released, we want to make the new Course Management as great as possible for you.{newLine} To do this we need your help! Let us know which features you're loving, which ones need improvement, and which ones need to be implemented sooner than others." extradata="course">
		<source><![CDATA[With continuous improvements being released, we want to make the new course management as great as possible for you.{newLine} To do this we need your help! Let us know which features you're loving, which ones need improvement, and which ones need to be implemented sooner than others.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Co lanzamento de melloras continuas, queremos que a nova xestión do curso sexa o mellor posible para ti.{newLine} Para iso necesitamos a túa axuda. Indícanos cales son as funcións que che gustan, cales precisan mellorar e cales hai que implementar antes que outras.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
