	<trans-unit id="As an Enterprise client, you can try all of the new features ahead of the official release. Note that you can switch to the new version only for your account, not for other users in the platform. Discover more in our &lt;b&gt;{X}&lt;/b&gt;" extradata="course_management">
		<source><![CDATA[Take a look at the new Course management, try all of the new features with a fresh interface and a smoother user experience, in Beta mode. Note that you can switch to the new version only for your account, not for other users in the platform.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Bótalle un ollo á nova xestión do curso, proba todas as novas funcións cunha interface nova e unha experiencia de usuario máis fluida no modo beta. Teña en conta que pode cambiar á nova versión só para a súa conta, non para outros usuarios da plataforma.]]></target>
