		<source><![CDATA[By trying out the DoceLab Beta Version of the new Course management, &lt;b&gt;you'll have access to the new interface and features before the official release&lt;/b&gt;. You can restore the old version for your account at any time.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; Don't forget to give your feedback so we can develop the best course management for you!]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao probar a versión beta de DoceLab da nova xestión do curso, &lt;b&gt;terá acceso á nova interface e funcións antes do lanzamento oficial&lt;/b&gt;. Podes restaurar a versión antiga da túa conta en calquera momento.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; Non esquezas dar os teus comentarios para que poidamos desenvolver a mellor xestión do curso para ti!]]></target>
