	<trans-unit id="Training material for the e-signature course is currently locked. By selecting Unlock, you can add, edit or remove training material. However, if you make changes to content, it may not be possible to prove the validity of e-signature of users who have completed the course. For more information about e-signature's validity, refer to our" extradata="course_management">
