	<trans-unit id="Users included in each of the selected groups will be part of the same cohort (one cohort per group). This means that users will only be able to see posts published by users in their own group, platform Superadmins, and Power Users with granted community administration permissions." extradata="default">
		<source><![CDATA[Users included in each of the selected groups will be part of the same cohort (one cohort per group). This means that users will only be able to see posts published by users in their own group, platform Superadmins, and Power Users with granted community administration permissions.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios incluídos en cada un dos grupos seleccionados formarán parte da mesma cohorte (unha cohorte por grupo). Isto significa que os usuarios só poderán ver as publicacións publicadas polos usuarios do seu propio grupo, superadministradores da plataforma e usuarios avanzados con permisos de administración da comunidade concedidos.]]></target>
