	<trans-unit id="Docebo's certificate creation function, operated in collaboration with Let's Encrypt, is considered an interim step. Docebo cannot guarantee the same operational standards as the Docebo Learn platform. To ensure security and control, Docebo advises you to obtain digital certificates through your trusted partners." extradata="domains">
		<source><![CDATA[Docebo's certificate creation function, operated in collaboration with Let's Encrypt, is considered an interim step. Docebo cannot guarantee the same operational standards as the Docebo platform. To ensure security and control, Docebo advises you to obtain digital certificates through your trusted partners.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[A función de creación de certificados de Docebo, operada en colaboración con Let's Encrypt, considérase un paso provisional. Docebo non pode garantir os mesmos estándares operativos que a plataforma Docebo. Para garantir a seguridade e o control, Docebo aconsella obter certificados dixitais a través dos seus socios de confianza.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Domain must be between second and fifth level" extradata="domains">
