	<trans-unit id="Adyen has scheduled the End of Life date for the Hosted Payment Pages (HPP) support on October 1, 2022. A new solution, called Web Drop-In, is available for you to continue using the Adyen integration. Configure it in the Adyen - Web Drop-In section of this page" extradata="ecommerce">
