	<trans-unit id="Enabling training credit will enable the Training credit wallet, Training credit shop, and Training credit management. A background job may be triggered to assign a price in training credits to all learning content currently on sale, using a 1:1 conversion rate with the default currency." extradata="ecommerce">
		<source><![CDATA[Enabling training credit will enable the Training credit wallet, Training credit shop, and Training credit management. A background job may be triggered to assign a price in training credits to all learning content currently on sale, using a 1:1 conversion rate with the default currency.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao activar o crédito de formación, activarase a carteira de créditos de formación, a tenda de créditos de formación e a xestión de créditos de formación. É posible que se active un traballo en segundo plano para asignar un prezo en créditos de formación a todo o contido de aprendizaxe actualmente á venda, utilizando unha taxa de conversión de 1:1 coa moeda predeterminada.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
