	<trans-unit id="Insert how many days the user can remain on course's waiting list while the wire payment is pending. Set the number of calendar days for the user to complete the payment. The payment deadline is set to 00:00 of the last available day for payment. Pending transactions will be automatically removed when the deadline is reached. Set this field to zero to configure no deadline to complete the payment." extradata="ecommerce">
		<source><![CDATA[Insert how many days the user can remain on the course's waiting list while the wire payment is pending. Set the number of calendar days for the user to complete the payment. The payment deadline is set to 00:00 of the last available day for payment. Pending transactions will be automatically removed when the deadline is reached. Set this field to zero to configure no deadline to complete the payment.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Insira cantos días pode permanecer o usuario na lista de agarda do curso mentres estea pendente o pago electrónico. Establece o número de días naturais para que o usuario complete o pago. O prazo de pago está fixado ás 00:00 horas do último día dispoñible para o pago. As transaccións pendentes eliminaranse automaticamente cando se cumpra o prazo. Establece este campo en cero para non configurar ningún prazo para completar o pago.]]></target>
