	<trans-unit id="Unpairing the Authenticator App, you won't have an extra layer of security for your profile anymore and you'll only use your password to sign in." extradata="esignature">
		<source><![CDATA[Unpairing the authenticator app, you won't have an extra layer of security for your profile anymore and you'll only use your password to sign in.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao desvincular a aplicación de autenticación, xa non terás unha capa adicional de seguranza para o teu perfil e só utilizarás o teu contrasinal para iniciar sesión.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
