	<trans-unit id="Use the Authenticator app to get free verification codes, even if your phone is offline. Available for Android and iOS." extradata="esignature">
		<source><![CDATA[Use the authenticator app to generate free verification codes, even if your device is offline. Available for Android and iOS.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Usa a aplicación de autenticación para xerar códigos de verificación gratuítos, aínda que o teu dispositivo estea sen conexión. Dispoñible para Android e iOS.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users will need to authenticate via OTP to complete the course. This option cannot be changed when editing the course properties." extradata="esignature">
		<source><![CDATA[Users will need to authenticate via one time password to complete the course. This option cannot be changed when editing the course properties.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios terán que autenticarse mediante un contrasinal único para completar o curso. Esta opción non se pode cambiar ao editar as propiedades do curso.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users will use an authenticator app as authentication tool." extradata="esignature">
		<source><![CDATA[Users will use an authenticator app as authentication tool]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios utilizarán unha aplicación de autenticación como ferramenta de autenticación]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users will use their email to receive the 6-digit verification code (OTP)." extradata="esignature">
		<source><![CDATA[Users will use their emails to receive the 6-digit verification code (one time password)]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios utilizarán os seus correos electrónicos para recibir o código de verificación de 6 díxitos (contrasinal único)]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
