	<trans-unit id="We asked you to save your emergency recovery key when you enabled the authenticator app." extradata="esignature">
		<source><![CDATA[We asked you to save your emergency recovery key when you enabled the authenticator app.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Pedímosche que gardases a túa clave de recuperación de emerxencia cando activaches a aplicación de autenticación.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="You are enrolled in E-Signature courses, where you will be asked to confirm your identity. There is no email associated with your profile &amp; as a consequence we cannot send you a One Time Password. Go to your “My Profile” page to provide a valid email address." extradata="esignature">
		<source><![CDATA[You are enrolled in e-signature courses, where you will be asked to confirm your identity. There is no email associated with your profile and as a consequence we cannot send you a one time password. Go to your “My profile” page to provide a valid email address.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Está matriculado en cursos de sinatura electrónica, nos que se lle pedirá que confirme a súa identidade. Non hai ningún correo electrónico asociado ao teu perfil e, como consecuencia, non podemos enviarche un contrasinal único. Vaia á páxina "O meu perfil" para proporcionar un enderezo de correo electrónico válido.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
