	<trans-unit id="Pressing Go To Slack V2 will open the new Slack V2 app in order to configure it. If the app is not installed on your platform, you will be redirected to the Apps and Features area to install it instead. This will allow you to preconfigure the new app in preparation for the new notifications when they become available on your platform" extradata="external-app">
		<source><![CDATA[Pressing Go To Slack V2 will open the new Slack V2 app in order to configure it. If the app is not installed on your platform, you will be redirected to the Apps and Features area to install it instead. This will allow you to preconfigure the new app in preparation for the new notifications when they become available on your platform.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Premendo Ir a Slack V2 abrirase a nova aplicación Slack V2 para configurala. Se a aplicación non está instalada na túa plataforma, serás redirixido á área Aplicacións e funcións para instalala. Isto permitirache preconfigurar a nova aplicación en preparación para as novas notificacións cando estean dispoñibles na túa plataforma.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Pressing Go To Slack V2 will open the new Slack V2 app in order to configure it. If the app is not installed on your platform, you will be redirected to the Apps and Features area to install it instead. This will allow you to preconfigure the new app in preparation for the new notifications when they become available on your platform. Slack V1 will reach the end of life on June 24, 2026." extradata="external-app">
		<source><![CDATA[Pressing Go To Slack V2 will open the new Slack V2 app in order to configure it. If the app is not installed on your platform, you will be redirected to the Apps and Features area to install it instead. This will allow you to preconfigure the new app in preparation for the new notifications when they become available on your platform. Slack V1 will reach the end of life on June 24, 2026.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Premendo Ir a Slack V2 abrirase a nova aplicación Slack V2 para configurala. Se a aplicación non está instalada na túa plataforma, serás redirixido á área Aplicacións e funcións para instalala. Isto permitirache preconfigurar a nova aplicación en preparación para as novas notificacións cando estean dispoñibles na túa plataforma. Slack V1 chegará ao final da súa vida útil o 24 de xuño de 2026.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
