	<trans-unit id="Are you sure you want to disable Learning Impact for the selected courses? By doing so, the selected courses will be removed from the list but the collected data will remain on the platform and the reports.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Do you want to proceed?" extradata="impact">
