	<trans-unit id="Are you sure you want to log into the platform as {username}? You'll be logged out from your profile and you'll log in as {username}.&lt;br&gt;Remember that all the actions you'll perform using {username}'s account will be tracked in the system as if they were performed by {username}." extradata="manage">
		<source><![CDATA[Are you sure you want to log in to the platform as {username}? You'll be logged out from your profile and you'll log in as {username}.&lt;br&gt;Please remember that all the actions you'll perform using this {username}'s account will be tracked in the system as if they were performed by {username}.]]></source>
