	<trans-unit id="By using Google Analytics, some of your end-users' information will be transmitted to Google via cookies or similar technologies. In some regions, you must ensure that certain information is provided to, and consent obtained from, the end-users. Docebo has no control over the information transferred to Google and is not responsible for the associated legal requirements. For more information, please review the Google data privacy and security policies as well as settings." extradata="manage">
		<source><![CDATA[By using Google Analytics, some of your end-users' information will be transmitted to Google via cookies or similar technologies. In some regions, you must ensure that certain information is provided to, and consent obtained from, the end-users. Docebo has no control over the information transferred to Google and is not responsible for the associated legal requirements. For more information, please review the Google data privacy and security policies as well as settings.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao usar Google Analytics, parte da información dos teus usuarios finais transmitirase a Google mediante cookies ou tecnoloxías similares. Nalgunhas rexións, debes asegurarte de que se proporciona certa información aos usuarios finais e obtén o consentimento dos mesmos. Docebo non ten control sobre a información transferida a Google e non se fai responsable dos requisitos legais asociados. Para obter máis información, consulta as políticas de privacidade e seguranza dos datos de Google, así como a configuración.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
