	<trans-unit id="If the group is inactive, {user_name} will have visibility into its users before activation and effective resource assignment." extradata="manage">
		<source><![CDATA[If the group is inactive, {user_name} will have visibility into its users before activation and effective resource assignment.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se o grupo está inactivo, {user_name} terá visibilidade dos seus usuarios antes da activación e da asignación efectiva dos recursos.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If the group is inactive, {user_name} will see the users manually added to the group before its activation and effective assignment. When the group is activated, its population is recalculated based on the new owner's assigned users and the group eligibility rules and the group users are assigned as resources to the new owner." extradata="manage">
		<source><![CDATA[If the group is inactive, {user_name} will see the users manually added to the group before its activation and effective assignment. When the group is activated, its population is recalculated based on the new owner's assigned users and the group eligibility rules and the group users are assigned as resources to the new owner.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se o grupo está inactivo, {user_name} verá os usuarios engadidos manualmente ao grupo antes da súa activación e asignación efectiva. Cando se activa o grupo, a súa poboación recalcúlase en función dos usuarios asignados ao novo propietario e as regras de elixibilidade do grupo e asígnanse os usuarios do grupo como recursos ao novo propietario.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you need to change the notification event type, create a new notification instead." extradata="manage">
		<source><![CDATA[If you need to change the notification event type, create a new notification instead]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se precisas cambiar o tipo de evento de notificación, crea unha nova notificación]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you proceed, both the manual and the automatic groups defined in your platform will be ported to the new Groups Management with their current population. The population of automatic groups will be recalculated from scratch according to the rules you defined for the group upon saving for the first time." extradata="manage">
		<source><![CDATA[If you proceed, both the manual and the automatic groups defined in your platform will be ported to the new groups management with their current population. The population of automatic groups will be recalculated from scratch according to the rules you defined for the group upon saving for the first time.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se continúa, tanto os grupos manuais como automáticos definidos na súa plataforma serán portados á nova xestión de grupos coa súa poboación actual. A poboación de grupos automáticos volverase calcular desde cero segundo as regras que definiches para o grupo ao gardar por primeira vez.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you proceed, you will remove the group from the assigned resources of its current owner and assign it as resource to {user_name}." extradata="manage">
		<source><![CDATA[If you proceed, you will remove the group from the assigned resources of its current owner and assign it as resource to {user_name}.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se continúas, eliminarás o grupo dos recursos asignados ao seu propietario actual e asignarao como recurso a {user_name}.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you switch the user assignment method to manual, {name_of_the_user} will be kept in this group and will no longer be subject to the conditions regulating the group population." extradata="manage">
		<source><![CDATA[If you switch the user assignment method to manual, {name_of_the_user} will be kept in this group and will no longer be subject to the conditions regulating the group population]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se cambias o método de asignación de usuarios ao manual, {name_of_the_user} manterase neste grupo e deixará de estar suxeito ás condicións que regulan a poboación do grupo]]></target>
