	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="&lt;h2&gt;About OpenSesame&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;OpenSesame is the trusted provider of on-demand elearning courses for enterprise companies. These organizations depend on OpenSesame to train millions of employees with an entirely new and better way—easier, more economical, with less risk—to access the best on-­demand training. With the world's largest library of 20,000+ business, safety, technology, and compliance courses&lt;/p&gt;" extradata="marketplace">
		<source><![CDATA[&lt;h2&gt;About OpenSesame&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;OpenSesame is the trusted provider of on-demand e-learning courses for enterprise companies. These organizations depend on OpenSesame to train millions of employees with an entirely new and better way—easier, more economical, with less risk—to access the best on-­demand training. With the world's largest library of 20,000+ business, safety, technology, and compliance courses&lt;/p&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[&lt;h2&gt;Acerca de OpenSesame&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;OpenSesame é o provedor de confianza de cursos e-learning baixo demanda para empresas empresariais. Estas organizacións dependen de OpenSesame para formar a millóns de empregados cunha forma totalmente nova e mellor (máis fácil, máis económica e con menos risco) de acceder á mellor formación baixo demanda. Coa biblioteca máis grande do mundo con máis de 20.000 cursos de empresas, seguridade, tecnoloxía e cumprimento&lt;/p&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="&lt;h2&gt;OpenSesame delivers:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Easy searching, deployment, and administration of courses through integration with Docebo&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p&gt;- The most flexible buying options to maximize your budget and to simplify procurement&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p&gt;- The broadest, freshest, deepest curated catalog from the world’s leading publishers to meet the needs of your training programs and objectives&lt;/p&gt;" extradata="marketplace">
		<source><![CDATA[&lt;h2&gt;OpenSesame delivers:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Easy searching, deployment, and administration of courses through integration with Docebo&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p&gt;- The most flexible buying options to maximize your budget and to simplify procurement&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p&gt;- The broadest, freshest, deepest curated catalog from the world’s leading publishers to meet the needs of your training programs and objectives&lt;/p&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[&lt;h2&gt;OpenSesame ofrece:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Fácil busca, implantación e administración de cursos mediante a integración con Docebo&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p&gt;- As opcións de compra máis flexibles para maximizar o seu orzamento e simplificar compras&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p&gt;- O catálogo seleccionado máis amplo, fresco e profundo dos principais editores do mundo para satisfacer as necesidades dos teus programas de formación e obxectivos&lt;/p&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
