	<trans-unit id="OpenSesame is the trusted provider of on-demand elearning courses for enterprise companies. These organizations depend on OpenSesame to train millions of employees with an entirely new and better way—easier, more economical, with less risk—to access the best on-­demand training. With the world's largest library of 20,000+ business, safety, technology, and compliance courses." extradata="marketplace">
		<source><![CDATA[OpenSesame is the trusted provider of on-demand e-learning courses for enterprise companies. These organizations depend on OpenSesame to train millions of employees with an entirely new and better way—easier, more economical, with less risk—to access the best on-­demand training. With the world's largest library of 20,000+ business, safety, technology, and compliance courses.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[OpenSesame é o provedor de confianza de cursos de e-learning baixo demanda para empresas. Estas organizacións dependen de OpenSesame para formar a millóns de empregados cunha forma totalmente nova e mellor (máis fácil, máis económica e con menos risco) de acceder á mellor formación baixo demanda. Coa biblioteca máis grande do mundo con máis de 20.000 cursos de empresas, seguridade, tecnoloxía e cumprimento.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
