	<trans-unit id="We are committed to providing the best learning opportunities to improve lives through education and training. We go to infinity and beyond through excellent work, prioritising actions over words, and encouraging creativity and candour. Our people love learning and all things great and small. We are 1 team. We put the team before ourselves – whether in a meeting room or on the soccer field!" extradata="marketplace">
		<source><![CDATA[We are committed to providing the best learning opportunities to improve lives through education and training. We go to infinity and beyond through excellent work, prioritizing actions over words, and encouraging creativity and candour. Our people love learning. We are 1 team. We put the team before ourselves – whether in a meeting room or on the soccer field!]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Comprometémonos a ofrecer as mellores oportunidades de aprendizaxe para mellorar a vida mediante a educación e a formación. Imos ao infinito e máis aló a través dun traballo excelente, priorizando as accións sobre as palabras e fomentando a creatividade e a franqueza. A nosa xente encántalle aprender. Somos 1 equipo. Poñemos o equipo antes que nós, xa sexa nunha sala de reunións ou no campo de fútbol!]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="We are here to help simplify the way that you learn." extradata="marketplace">
		<source><![CDATA[We are here to help simplify the way in which you learn.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Estamos aquí para axudar a simplificar a forma en que aprendes.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
