	<trans-unit id="You are previewing the new Docebo Content experience. We'd love your feedback! You can go back to the old experience any time using this banner. Remember that any changes you make while in preview mode will be reflected in your live environment." extradata="marketplace">
		<source><![CDATA[You are previewing the new Docebo Content experience. We'd love your feedback! You can go back to the old experience any time using this banner. Remember that any changes you make while in preview mode will be reflected in your live environment.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Estás a ver a nova experiencia de contido de Docebo. Encantaríanos o teu comentario! Podes volver á experiencia antiga en calquera momento usando este banner. Lembra que os cambios que fagas mentres estás no modo de vista previa reflectiranse no teu ambiente en directo.]]></target>
