		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas a habilidade seleccionada, a plataforma eliminará o contido relacionado coa habilidade da canle As miñas habilidades. Ademais, xa non recibirás actualizacións sobre o contido relacionado con esta habilidade. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete this answer, no one will be able to read it, Do you want to proceed?" extradata="mobile">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete this answer, no one will be able to read it. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas esta resposta, ninguén poderá lela. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete this playlist, it will not be visible anymore in the channels to which you assigned it, This playlist will also be removed from your channel page" extradata="mobile">
