	<trans-unit id="If your app allows users to access paid content that they haven't purchased within the app, your app may be rejected by the App Store. In order to be compliant with Apple's App Store Review Guidelines, you need to enable the Reader App mode, generate your build and upload it on the App Store." extradata="mobile">
		<source><![CDATA[If your app allows users to access paid content that they haven't purchased within the app, your app may be rejected by the App Store. In order to be compliant with Apple's App Store review guidelines, you need to enable the reader app mode, generate your build and upload it on the App Store.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se a túa aplicación permite aos usuarios acceder a contido de pago que non compraron na aplicación, a App Store pode rexeitar a túa aplicación. Para cumprir coas directrices de revisión da App Store de Apple, debes activar o modo de aplicación lectora, xerar a túa compilación e cargala na App Store.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
