	<trans-unit id="APK is the standard format used by Android. It creates larger packages, but it assures a better compatibility across devices and Mobile Device Management (MDM) systems" extradata="mobilerebranding">
		<source><![CDATA[APK format is no longer supported by the Play Store starting August 2021, but you can still use it to publish your app using your Mobile Device Management (MDM) system. 
APK format creates larger packages, but it assures a better compatibility across devices and MDM systems.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Play Store xa non admite o formato APK a partir de agosto de 2021, pero aínda podes utilizalo para publicar a túa aplicación mediante o teu sistema de xestión de dispositivos móbiles (MDM). 
O formato APK crea paquetes máis grandes, pero garante unha mellor compatibilidade entre dispositivos e sistemas MDM.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
