	<trans-unit id="Upload the required configuration file for each mobile platform (iOS and Android) you’ve enabled for your app. If you make changes to your Firebase settings—such as enabling new services—be sure to do" extradata="mobilerebranding">
		<source><![CDATA[Upload the required configuration file for each mobile platform (iOS and Android) you’ve enabled for your app. If you make changes to your Firebase settings—such as enabling new services—be sure to download and upload the updated configuration files.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Carga o ficheiro de configuración necesario para cada plataforma móbil (iOS e Android) que activaches para a túa aplicación. Se realizas cambios na túa configuración de Firebase, como activar novos servizos, asegúrate de descargar e cargar os ficheiros de configuración actualizados.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Use the format: teamID.bundleID (eg ABCD1234.com.acme.wwdc). You can find this in the Certificates, Identifiers &amp; Profiles section of the Apple Developer Console" extradata="mobilerebranding">
		<source><![CDATA[Use the format: teamID.bundleID (eg ABCD1234.com.acme.wwdc). You can find this in the Certificates, Identifiers &amp; Profiles section of the Apple Developer Console.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Use o formato: teamID.bundleID (por exemplo, ABCD1234.com.acme.wwdc). Podes atopalo nos certificados, identificadores e amp; Sección de perfís da Apple Developer Console.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users will be able to continue to play audio or video files even when they send the app to the background, switch to another app, and also when they lock or turn off the screen" extradata="mobilerebranding">
		<source><![CDATA[Users will be able to continue to play audio or video files even when they send the app to the background, switch to another app, and also when they lock or turn off the screen]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios poderán seguir reproducindo ficheiros de audio ou vídeo mesmo cando envíen a aplicación en segundo plano, cambien a outra aplicación e tamén cando bloqueen ou apaguen a pantalla]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Using AAB will result in smaller downloads for end users, but, since it requires the mandatory usage of the &quot;app signing by Google Play&quot;, your app could be less compliant with Mobile Device Management (MDM) systems" extradata="mobilerebranding">
		<source><![CDATA[AAB is the new standard format used by Android. Starting August 2021, this format is mandatory to publish apps on the Play Store. 
Using AAB will result in smaller downloads for learners, but, since it requires the mandatory usage of the &quot;app signing by Google Play&quot;, your app could be less compliant with Mobile Device Management (MDM) systems.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[AAB é o novo formato estándar usado por Android. A partir de agosto de 2021, este formato é obrigatorio para publicar aplicacións na Play Store. 
O uso de AAB producirá descargas máis pequenas para os alumnos, pero, dado que require o uso obrigatorio da &quot;sinatura de aplicacións por parte de Google Play&quot;, a túa aplicación podería ser menos compatible cos sistemas de xestión de dispositivos móbiles (MDM).]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="View the build history from the past three months. The latest build can be downloaded for up to three months. After that, you’ll need to generate a new build." extradata="mobilerebranding">
		<source><![CDATA[View the build history from the past three months. The latest build can be downloaded for up to three months. After that, you’ll need to generate a new build.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Consulta o historial de construción dos últimos tres meses. A versión máis recente pódese descargar ata tres meses. Despois diso, terás que xerar unha nova compilación.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When enabled, your generated builds are automatically re-signed and submitted to App Store Connect and Google Play Console" extradata="mobilerebranding">
		<source><![CDATA[When enabled, your generated builds are automatically re-signed and submitted to App Store Connect and Google Play Console]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando se activa, as compilacións xeradas volven asinarse automaticamente e envíanse a App Store Connect e Google Play Console]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When the process is complete you can download the new unsigned builds. Previous builds will no longer be available." extradata="mobilerebranding">
		<source><![CDATA[When the process is complete you can download the new unsigned builds. Previous builds will no longer be available.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando remate o proceso, podes descargar as novas compilacións sen asinar. As versións anteriores xa non estarán dispoñibles.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
