	<trans-unit id="You are about to generate an app package for publication. By proceeding, this app package and other information that you inserted during the creation process will be sent to the provided email address. Please note that you will no longer be able to download your previous builds." extradata="mobilerebranding">
		<source><![CDATA[You are about to generate an app package for publication. By proceeding, this app package and other information that you inserted during the creation process will be sent to the provided email address. Please note that you will no longer be able to download your previous builds.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Estás a piques de xerar un paquete de aplicacións para a súa publicación. Ao continuar, este paquete de aplicacións e outra información que inseriches durante o proceso de creación enviaranse ao enderezo de correo electrónico proporcionado. Ten en conta que xa non poderás descargar as túas versións anteriores.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="You are about to start creating your own learning app. Contact your Customer Success Manager if you need help on retrieving the data required by the creation process." extradata="mobilerebranding">
