	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Hi, We want to inform you that the endpoint configured for the {1} webhook has repeatedly generated the following error: {2} {3}, and Docebo has deactivated it. Errors have been recorded on the Docebo platform associated with the {4} domain. Please check it out and reactivate the webhook when the problem is solved." extradata="notificationerror">
		<source><![CDATA[Hi, we want to inform you that the endpoint configured for the {1} webhook has repeatedly generated the following error: {2} {3}, and Docebo has deactivated it. Errors have been recorded on the Docebo platform associated with the {4} domain. Please check it out and reactivate the webhook when the problem is solved, or contact our help desk service.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ola, queremos informarche de que o punto final configurado para o webhook {1} xerou repetidamente o seguinte erro: {2} {3} e Docebo desactivouno. Rexistráronse erros na plataforma Docebo asociada ao dominio {4}. Compróbao e reactiva o webhook cando se resolva o problema, ou ponte en contacto co noso servizo de asistencia.]]></target>
