	<trans-unit id="Conditional learning path, pre-test" extradata="organization">
		<source><![CDATA[&lt;b&gt;Completion of the first mandatory training material:&lt;/b&gt; Learners can access the training materials of the course only after they have completed and passed the first training material in the list. They will be then able to view the other training materials either in their preferred order or in the sequential order set for the course.]]></source>
