	<trans-unit id="Suggested for content that you want to put front and center, as this mode grays and obscures the rest of the page content when the object is playing. Not recommended for Flash packages." extradata="player">
		<source><![CDATA[Suggested if you are placing your content in the front or in the center of the page, as this mode greys and obscures the rest of the page content when the object is playing. Not recommended for Flash packages.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Suxerido se estás colocando o teu contido na parte frontal ou no centro da páxina, xa que este modo engasa e oculta o resto do contido da páxina cando se reproduce o obxecto. Non recomendado para paquetes Flash.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
