	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Suggested to limit distractions or allow learners to switch quickly between other content. We strongly suggest to preview the content on your mobile device before making it available to your users, since some files may not be displayed properly." extradata="player">
		<source><![CDATA[Suggested to limit distractions or to allow learners to quickly switch to other contents. We strongly suggest previewing the content on your mobile device before making it available to your users, since some files may not be displayed properly.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Suxerido para limitar as distraccións ou para permitir que os alumnos cambien rapidamente a outros contidos. Suxerímoslle encarecidamente que previsualice o contido no seu dispositivo móbil antes de facelo dispoñible para os usuarios, xa que é posible que algúns ficheiros non se mostren correctamente.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Suggested to play content in the front of the page, as this mode opens the content in a window and hides the rest of the page when learners are viewing it. Not recommended for Flash packages." extradata="player">
		<source><![CDATA[Suggested to play content in the front of the page, as this mode opens the content in a window and hides the rest of the page when learners are viewing it. Not recommended for Flash packages.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Recoméndase reproducir contido na parte frontal da páxina, xa que este modo abre o contido nunha xanela e oculta o resto da páxina cando os alumnos o están a ver. Non recomendado para paquetes Flash.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Suggested to play only the training material in the course page, limiting distractions and allowing learners to switch to other pieces of content quickly. Recommended for old Flash packages." extradata="player">
		<source><![CDATA[Suggested to play only the training material in the course page, limiting distractions and allowing learners to switch to other pieces of content quickly. Recommended for old Flash packages.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Suxírese reproducir só o material de formación da páxina do curso, limitando as distraccións e permitindo que os alumnos cambien rapidamente a outros contidos. Recomendado para paquetes Flash antigos.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="The &lt;span class=&quot;tooltip-red-text&quot;&gt;fallback track&lt;/span&gt; is used when there are no subtitles available for the user language" extradata="player">
