	<trans-unit id="When you grant group permissions, Power Users can view the eligibility rules for all automatic groups, and you are potentially exposing resources not directly assigned to them. However, they can only manage rules for the automatic groups where they are designated as owners and according to the permissions you grant them." extradata="poweruser">
		<source><![CDATA[When you grant group permissions, Power Users can view the eligibility rules for all automatic groups, and you are potentially exposing resources not directly assigned to them. However, they can only manage rules for the automatic groups where they are designated as owners and according to the permissions you grant them.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando concedes permisos de grupo, os usuarios avanzados poden ver as regras de elixibilidade de todos os grupos automáticos e, potencialmente, estás expoñendo recursos que non están directamente asignados a eles. Non obstante, só poden xestionar regras para os grupos automáticos nos que están designados como propietarios e segundo os permisos que lles outorgue.]]></target>
