	<trans-unit id="You are about to remove the selected profile from the Power User. If you remove it, the profile will not be deleted, but since this profile is not assigned to you, you will not be able to grant it back.{newLine}Do you want to proceed?" extradata="poweruser">
		<source><![CDATA[You are about to remove the selected profile from the Power User. If you remove it, the profile will not be deleted, but since this profile is not assigned to you, you will not be able to grant it back.{newLine}Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
