	<trans-unit id="Activating the proctoring functionality will reset the tracking for all users who currently have this test marked as In progress when they attempt to resume their test. Their progress will be changed to Not started and they will have to start the test from the beginning again." extradata="proctoring">
		<source><![CDATA[Activating the proctoring functionality will reset the tracking for all users who currently have this test marked as In progress when they attempt to resume their test. Their progress will be changed to Not started and they will have to start the test from the beginning again.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao activar a función de vixilancia restablecerá o seguimento de todos os usuarios que teñan esta proba marcada como En curso cando intenten retomar a súa proba. O seu progreso cambiarase a Non iniciado e terán que comezar de novo a proba desde o principio.]]></target>
