	<trans-unit id="Are you sure you want to reset the Honorlock credentials? If you proceed you will no longer be able to use the integration with Honorlock as you will lose your existing API key and API secret values. All other options will remain as you have configured them." extradata="proctoring">
		<source><![CDATA[Are you sure you want to reset the Honorlock credentials? If you proceed you will no longer be able to use the integration with Honorlock as you will lose your existing API key and API secret values. All other options will remain as you have configured them.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Estás seguro de que queres restablecer as credenciais de Honorlock? Se continúas, xa non poderás utilizar a integración con Honorlock xa que perderás a túa clave API existente e os valores secretos da API. Todas as outras opcións permanecerán tal e como as configuraches.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Are you sure you want to resynchronize these tests? This action will only affect tests that are currently in finalization status. Please note that performing this action may take a long time." extradata="proctoring">
		<source><![CDATA[Are you sure you want to resynchronize these tests? This action will only affect tests that are currently in finalization status. Please note that performing this action may take a long time.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Estás seguro de que queres volver sincronizar estas probas? Esta acción só afectará ás probas que estean actualmente en estado de finalización. Ten en conta que realizar esta acción pode levar moito tempo.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By using Honorlock, some information of your end-users will be transmitted to Honorlock via cookies or similar technologies. In some regions, you must ensure that certain information is given to, and consents obtained from, the end user. Docebo has no control over the information transferred to Honorlock and is not responsible for the associated legal requirements. For more information, please review Honorlock data privacy and security policies and settings." extradata="proctoring">
		<source><![CDATA[By using Honorlock, some information of your end users will be transmitted to Honorlock via cookies or similar technologies. In some regions, you must ensure that certain information is given to, and consents obtained from, the end user. Docebo has no control over the information transferred to Honorlock and is not responsible for the associated legal requirements. For more information, please review Honorlock data privacy and security policies and settings.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao usar Honorlock, parte da información dos teus usuarios finais transmitirase a Honorlock mediante cookies ou tecnoloxías similares. Nalgunhas rexións, debe asegurarse de que se lle proporciona certa información ao usuario final e que se obteñen os consentimentos do mesmo. Docebo non ten control sobre a información transferida a Honorlock e non se fai responsable dos requisitos legais asociados. Para obter máis información, consulte as políticas e a configuración de seguridade e privacidade dos datos de Honorlock.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
