	<trans-unit id="If enabled, this option will automatically set the test status to Invalid if the threshold has been exceeded. Otherwise, all test sessions that exceed the thresholds below will remain in a Needs proctoring review status until they are manually reviewed and set as validated or rejected." extradata="proctoring">
		<source><![CDATA[If enabled, this option will automatically set the test status to Invalid if the threshold has been exceeded. Otherwise, all test sessions that exceed the thresholds below will remain in a Needs proctoring review status until they are manually reviewed and set as validated or rejected.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se está activada, esta opción establecerá automaticamente o estado da proba como Non válido se se superou o limiar. En caso contrario, todas as sesións de proba que excedan os limiares seguintes permanecerán en estado de revisión de vixilancia de necesidades ata que se revisen manualmente e se establezan como validadas ou rexeitadas.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If unselected, only the default text will display for the learner. (Default message: Your session requires validation by Honorlock)." extradata="proctoring">
		<source><![CDATA[If unselected, only the default text will display for the learner. (Default message: Your session requires validation by Honorlock).]]></source>
