	<trans-unit id="QUICK_REG_MAIL_TEXT" extradata="register">
		<source><![CDATA[We have received your subscription request with the following information:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
UserID : [userid]&lt;br/&gt;
Temporary password: [password]&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
To complete the registration process, please click on the link below, (or copy it in your web browser address bar)&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;[link]&quot;&gt;[link]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
This request will be valid for the next [hour] hours]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Recibimos a túa solicitude de subscrición coa seguinte información:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
ID de usuario: [ID de usuario]&lt;br/&gt;
Contrasinal temporal: [contrasinal]&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Para completar o proceso de rexistro, faga clic na seguinte ligazón (ou cópiea na barra de enderezos do seu navegador web)&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
