	<trans-unit id="By confirming this dialog, you're going to export the selected audit trail. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt; Please note that, once an event takes place, it may be available in the export up to five minutes after it occurred. &lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Do you want to export the audit trail?&lt;br&gt;" extradata="report">
		<source><![CDATA[By confirming this dialog, you're going to export the selected audit trail. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt; Please note that, once an event takes place, it may be available in the export up to five minutes after it occurred. &lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Do you want to export the audit trail?&lt;br&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao confirmar este diálogo, exportará a pista de auditoría seleccionada. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;forte&gt; Ten en conta que, unha vez que teña lugar un evento, pode estar dispoñible na exportación ata cinco minutos despois de que ocorrese. &lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Queres exportar a pista de auditoría?&lt;br&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By confirming this dialog, you're going to export the selected report. &lt;br&gt; It seems you didn't save some of the changes you made. You must save your changes before exporting the report. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; This process will run in the background. You'll be notified when the background job is completed. &lt;br&gt; Please note that &lt;strong&gt;the data in the report is not real-time, the last update is on {currentDateAndTime}&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Do you want to export the report?" extradata="report">
		<source><![CDATA[By confirming this dialog, you're going to export the selected report. &lt;br&gt; It seems you didn't save some of the changes you made. You must save your changes before exporting the report. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; This process will run in the background. You'll be notified when the background job is completed. &lt;br&gt; Please note that &lt;strong&gt;the data in the report is not real-time, the last update is on {currentDateAndTime}&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Do you want to export the report?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao confirmar este diálogo, exportará o informe seleccionado. &lt;br&gt; Parece que non gardou algúns dos cambios que fixeches. Debe gardar os cambios antes de exportar o informe. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Este proceso executarase en segundo plano. Recibirás unha notificación cando remate o traballo en segundo plano. &lt;br&gt; Ten en conta que &lt;strong&gt;os datos do informe non son en tempo real, a última actualización é o {currentDateAndTime}&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Queres exportar o informe?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By confirming this dialog, you're going to export the selected report. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; This process will run in the background, so you can continue to use your LMS without any restrictions while we're exporting all of the data. You'll be notified when the background job is completed. Please note that &lt;strong&gt;the data in the report is not real-time, the last update is on {currentDateAndTime}&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Do you want to export the report?" extradata="report">
		<source><![CDATA[Confirming this dialog will export the selected report. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; This process will run in the background, so you can continue to use your platform without any restrictions while we are exporting all the data. You will be notified when the background job is completed. Please note that &lt;strong&gt;the data in the report is not real-time, the last update is on {currentDateAndTime}&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Do you want to export the report?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao confirmar este diálogo exportarase o informe seleccionado. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Este proceso executarase en segundo plano, polo que podes seguir usando a túa plataforma sen restricións mentres exportamos todos os datos. Recibirás unha notificación cando remate o traballo en segundo plano. Ten en conta que &lt;strong&gt;os datos do informe non son en tempo real, a última actualización é o {currentDateAndTime}&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Queres exportar o informe?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By confirming this dialog, you're going to export the selected report. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; This process will run in the background. You'll be notified when the background job is completed. &lt;br&gt; Please note that &lt;strong&gt;the data in the report is not real-time, the last update is on {currentDateAndTime}&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Do you want to export the report?" extradata="report">
		<source><![CDATA[By confirming this dialog, you're going to export the selected report. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; This process will run in the background. You'll be notified when the background job is completed. &lt;br&gt; Please note that &lt;strong&gt;the data in the report is not real-time, the last update is on {currentDateAndTime}&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Do you want to export the report?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao confirmar este diálogo, exportará o informe seleccionado. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Este proceso executarase en segundo plano. Recibirás unha notificación cando remate o traballo en segundo plano. &lt;br&gt; Ten en conta que &lt;strong&gt;os datos do informe non son en tempo real, a última actualización é o {currentDateAndTime}&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Queres exportar o informe?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By confirming this message, you're going to export the selected report." extradata="report">
		<source><![CDATA[By confirming this message, you're going to export the selected report.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao confirmar esta mensaxe, exportarás o informe seleccionado.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By flagging this option, users will have to login in order to download the report using the link they received via email. If this option is not flagged, everyone who has the link can download the report, with the risk of losing control of data. Only Superadmins can flag or unflag this option." extradata="report">
		<source><![CDATA[If this option is flagged, users will have to login in order to download the report using the link.
If this option is not flagged, everyone who has the link can download the report, with the risk of losing control of data.
If you are a Power User, please contact your Superadmin to flag or unflag this option.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se esta opción está marcada, os usuarios terán que iniciar sesión para descargar o informe mediante a ligazón.
Se esta opción non está marcada, todos os que teñan a ligazón poden descargar o informe, co risco de perder o control dos datos.
Se es un usuario avanzado, póñase en contacto co seu superadministrador para marcar ou desmarcar esta opción.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By migrating the custom reports from the old Reports menu to the New Reports menu, you'll be able to view and edit your reports using the new features available for the New Custom Reports. Only the reports created after January 1, 2019 will be migrated. Please note that the following configurations will be migrated:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; - Properties&lt;br&gt; - Visibility&lt;br&gt; - Filters&lt;br&gt; - Report fields&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; But the schedules configured for the report &lt;b&gt;won't be migrated.&lt;/b&gt;" extradata="report">
		<source><![CDATA[By migrating the reports from the Legacy reports menu to the Reports menu, you will be able to view and edit your reports using the latest features. Only the reports created after January 1, 2019 will be migrated. Please note that the following configurations will be migrated:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; - Properties&lt;br&gt; - Visibility&lt;br&gt; - Filters&lt;br&gt; - Report fields&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; But the schedules configured for the report &lt;b&gt;won't be migrated.&lt;/b&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao migrar os informes do menú Informes legados ao menú Informes, poderás ver e editar os teus informes utilizando as funcións máis recentes. Só se migrarán os informes creados despois do 1 de xaneiro de 2019. Teña en conta que migraranse as seguintes configuracións:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; - Propiedades&lt;br&gt; - Visibilidade&lt;br&gt; - Filtros&lt;br&gt; - Campos de informe&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Pero as programacións configuradas para o informe &lt;b&gt;non se migrarán.&lt;/b&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By migrating the custom reports from the old Reports menu to the New Reports menu, you'll be able to view and edit your reports using the new features available for the New Custom Reports. Only the reports created after January 1, 2019 will be migrated. Please note that when migrating a scheduled report, the report will be migrated, but without its schedules. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;b&gt;Remember that, if you migrate the same report more than once, all of the changes you made to the migrated report will be overwritten.&lt;/b&gt;" extradata="report">
		<source><![CDATA[By migrating the reports from the Legacy reports menu to the Reports menu, you will be able to view and edit your reports using the latest features. Only the reports created after January 1, 2019 will be migrated.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Please note that the following configurations will be migrated:
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;- Properties&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;- Visibility&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;- Filters&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;- Report fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
but the schedules configured for the report &lt;b&gt;won't be migrated&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;b&gt;Remember that, if you migrate the same report more than once, all of the changes you made to the migrated report will be overwritten.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao migrar os informes do menú Informes legados ao menú Informes, poderás ver e editar os teus informes utilizando as funcións máis recentes. Só se migrarán os informes creados despois do 1 de xaneiro de 2019.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Teña en conta que migraranse as seguintes configuracións:
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;- Propiedades&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;- Visibilidade&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;- Filtros&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;- Campos de informe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
pero as programacións configuradas para o informe &lt;b&gt;non se migrarán&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;b&gt;Lembre que, se migra o mesmo informe máis dunha vez, sobrescribiranse todos os cambios que fixera no informe migrado.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By pressing the update button in this dialog, you're going to refresh the data." extradata="report">
		<source><![CDATA[By pressing the update button in this dialog, you're going to refresh the data.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao premer o botón de actualización deste diálogo, vai actualizar os datos.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By refreshing your data, you will update the data of all your reports to the current date and time. &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; Please note that this operation may take up to two hours to complete and it may impact on the activities that other users are carrying out. Make sure you refresh your data only when it is necessary." extradata="report">
		<source><![CDATA[By refreshing your data, you will update the data of all your reports to the current date and time. &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; Please note that this operation may take up to two hours to complete and it may impact on the activities that other users are carrying out. Make sure you refresh your data only when it is necessary.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao actualizar os seus datos, actualizará os datos de todos os seus informes á data e hora actual. &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; Ten en conta que esta operación pode tardar ata dúas horas en completarse e pode afectar ás actividades que están a realizar outros usuarios. Asegúrate de actualizar os teus datos só cando sexa necesario.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
