	<trans-unit id="If this option is flagged, users will have to login in order to download the report using the link. If this option is not flagged, everyone who has the link can download the report, with the risk of losing control of data. If you cannot activate or deactivate this option, please contact your Superadmin." extradata="report">
		<source><![CDATA[If this option is flagged, users will have to login in order to download the report using the link. If this option is not flagged, everyone who has the link can download the report, with the risk of losing control of data. If you cannot activate or deactivate this option, please contact your Superadmin.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se esta opción está marcada, os usuarios terán que iniciar sesión para descargar o informe mediante a ligazón. Se esta opción non está marcada, todos os que teñan a ligazón poden descargar o informe, co risco de perder o control dos datos. Se non pode activar ou desactivar esta opción, póñase en contacto co seu superadministrador.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
