	<trans-unit id="Some Identity Providers/Federations may require that Service Providers hold a certificate. If you enable a certificate for your Service Provider, it may be able to sign requests and response sent to the Identity Provider, as well as receiving encrypted re" extradata="simplesaml">
		<source><![CDATA[Some identity providers/federations may require that service providers hold a certificate. If you enable a certificate for your service provider, it may be able to sign requests and responses sent to the identity provider, as well as receiving encrypted responses.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Algúns provedores/federacións de identidade poden requirir que os provedores de servizos posúan un certificado. Se activas un certificado para o teu fornecedor de servizos, é posible que poida asinar solicitudes e respostas enviadas ao fornecedor de identidade, así como recibir respostas cifradas.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
