	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="From now on, a new area will be available to you. Discover every day new content from the web and from the platform, based on your skills." extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[From now on, a new area will be available to you. Discover every day new content from the web and from the platform, based on your skills.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[A partir de agora, unha nova área estará dispoñible para ti. Descubre cada día novos contidos da web e da plataforma, en función das túas habilidades.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="From now on, skills based channels will be able to browse the platform and push to your users the best content to fit their interests basing on their role and skills.&lt;br&gt;Hurry up and enable them getting the wider and most powerful skill based content source than ever." extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[From now on, skills based channels will be able to browse the platform and push to your users the best content to fit their interests basing on their role and skills.&lt;br&gt;Hurry up and enable them getting the wider and most powerful skill based content source than ever.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[A partir de agora, as canles baseadas en habilidades poderán navegar pola plataforma e enviar aos teus usuarios o mellor contido que se adapte aos seus intereses en función do seu papel e habilidades.&lt;br&gt;Apresúrate e permítelles obter a fonte de contido baseada en habilidades máis ampla e poderosa que nunca.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="From now on, you can set a target level for your skills and receive improved content suggestions" extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[From now on, you can set a target level for your skills and receive improved content suggestions]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[A partir de agora, pode establecer un nivel obxectivo para as súas habilidades e recibir suxestións de contido mellorados]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="From now on, you will be able to upskill and being engaged everyday with new content based on your skills." extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[From now on, you will be able to upskill and be engaged everyday with new content based on your skills.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[A partir de agora, poderás mellorar as túas habilidades e participar todos os días con novos contidos baseados nas túas habilidades.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Go to Channel Management" extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[Go to Channel management]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Vai a Xestión da canle]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
