		<target><![CDATA[Vai á configuración da canle]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Good news for you! From now on, you will find the best content from the platform that fits your skills and role." extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[Good news for you! From now on, you will find the best content from the platform that fits your skills and role.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Boas noticias para ti! A partir de agora, atoparás o mellor contido da plataforma que se adapte ás túas habilidades e función.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Help us finding the right skills for you" extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[Help us find the right skills for you]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Axúdanos a atopar as habilidades adecuadas para ti]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If this option is flagged, users and Power Users will be able to add any skills to courses and assets, regardless of skills' custom visibility settings." extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[If this option is selected, users and Power Users will be able to add any skills to courses and assets, regardless of skills' custom visibility settings.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se se selecciona esta opción, os usuarios e os usuarios avanzados poderán engadir calquera habilidade aos cursos e recursos, independentemente da configuración de visibilidade personalizada das habilidades.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete the set of skills selected, users will lose skills and content related to them. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete the set of skills selected, users will lose skills and content related to them. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas o conxunto de habilidades seleccionados, os usuarios perderán habilidades e contidos relacionados con elas. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete the sets of skills selected, users will lose skills and content related to them. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete the sets of skills selected, users will lose skills and content related to them. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas os conxuntos de habilidades seleccionados, os usuarios perderán as habilidades e o contido relacionado con eles. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete these skills from your Platform Catalog, they will be removed from all users and content they are assigned to. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete these skills from your platform catalog, they will be removed from all users and content they are assigned to. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas estas habilidades do catálogo da túa plataforma, eliminaranse de todos os usuarios e contidos aos que estean asignados. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete this skill from your Platform Catalog, it will be removed from all users and content it is assigned to. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete this skill from your platform catalog, it will be removed from all users and content it is assigned to. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas esta habilidade do catálogo da túa plataforma, eliminarase de todos os usuarios e contidos aos que estea asignada. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you publish this set of skills, only users with visibility permissions for this set will be requested to choose their skills when they first sign in." extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[If you publish this set of skills, only users with visibility permissions for this set will be requested to choose their skills when they first sign in.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se publicas este conxunto de habilidades, só se lles pedirá aos usuarios con permisos de visibilidade para este conxunto que escollan as súas habilidades cando inicien sesión por primeira vez.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you publish this set of skills, only users with visibility permissions for this set will be requested to choose their skills when they first sign in. The skills will be added to your Platform Catalog." extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[If you publish this set of skills, only users with visibility permissions for this set will be requested to choose their skills when they first sign in. The skills will be added to your platform catalog.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se publicas este conxunto de habilidades, só se solicitará aos usuarios con permisos de visibilidade para este conxunto que escollan as súas habilidades cando inicien sesión por primeira vez. As habilidades engadiranse ao catálogo da túa plataforma.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you remove the selected Skill, the platform will remove the content related to the Skill from the My Skills channel and you will lose your progress on it. In addition, you will no longer receive updates on the content related to this Skill.{spacing}Do you want to proceed?" extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[If you remove the selected skill, the platform will remove the content related to the skill from the My skills channel and you will lose your progress on it. In addition, you will no longer receive updates on the content related to this skill.{spacing}Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas a habilidade seleccionada, a plataforma eliminará o contido relacionado coa habilidade da canle As miñas habilidades e perderás o teu progreso nela. Ademais, xa non recibirás actualizacións sobre o contido relacionado con esta habilidade.{spacing}Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you unassign the selected content from the skill, the content will be removed in all of the sets where the skill is available and users will no longer be able to access it. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[If you unassign the selected content from the skill, the content will be removed from all the sets where the skill is available and users will no longer be able to access it. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se anulas a asignación do contido seleccionado da habilidade, o contido eliminarase de todos os conxuntos nos que a habilidade estea dispoñible e os usuarios xa non poderán acceder a el. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you unassign the selected skills from the set, users who haven't configured them yet will not be able to select them among the skills suggested.&lt;br/&gt;However, the selected skills will still be assigned to users who have already configured them. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="skills">
		<source><![CDATA[If you unassign the selected skills from the set, users who haven't configured them yet will not be able to select them among the skills suggested.&lt;br/&gt;However, the selected skills will still be assigned to users who have already configured them. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se anulas a asignación das habilidades seleccionadas do conxunto, os usuarios que aínda non as configurasen non poderán seleccionalas entre as habilidades suxeridas.&lt;br/&gt;Non obstante, as habilidades seleccionadas seguirán asignando aos usuarios que xa as configurasen. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
