	<trans-unit id="&lt;p&gt;In order to make any payment transaction faster and safer, we recently updated our payment gateway." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;In order to make all payment transactions faster and safer, we recently updated our payment gateway.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;Para que todas as transaccións de pago sexan máis rápidas e seguras, actualizamos recentemente a nosa pasarela de pago.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="&lt;p&gt;In order to make any payment transaction faster and safer, we recently updated our payment gateway. To continue renewing your LMS subscription, we kindly ask you 1 minute to re-enter your credit card information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;/p&gt;" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;In order to make any payment transaction faster and safer, we recently updated our payment gateway. To continue renewing your platform subscription, we kindly ask you one minute of your time to re-enter your credit card information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;/p&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;Co fin de facer calquera transacción de pago máis rápida e segura, actualizamos recentemente a nosa pasarela de pago. Para continuar renovando a túa subscrición á plataforma, pedímosche un minuto do teu tempo para que volvas introducir a información da túa tarxeta de crédito.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grazas!&lt;/p&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="&lt;p&gt;Your account has an outstanding balance. Please submit your payment or contact our team for future details.&lt;/p&gt;" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;Your account has an outstanding balance. Please submit your payment or contact our team for future details.&lt;/p&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;A túa conta ten un saldo pendente. Envía o teu pago ou ponte en contacto co noso equipo para obter máis detalles.&lt;/p&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="&lt;p&gt;Your credit card payment &lt;strong&gt;failed {days} days ago&lt;/strong&gt; (on {dateExpired})&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You are in grace period and &lt;strong&gt;you must renew your subscription in order to continue using your LMS.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;Your credit card payment &lt;strong&gt;failed {days} days ago&lt;/strong&gt; (on {dateExpired})&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You are in grace period and &lt;strong&gt;you must renew your subscription in order to continue using your platform.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;O pago da túa tarxeta de crédito &lt;strong&gt;fallou hai {días} días&lt;/strong&gt; (o {dateExpired})&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Estás en período de carencia e &lt;strong&gt;debes renovar a túa subscrición para seguir usando a túa plataforma.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="&lt;p&gt;Your subscription &lt;strong&gt;expired {days} days ago&lt;/strong&gt; (on {dateExpired})&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You are in grace period and &lt;strong&gt;you must renew your subscription in order to continue using your LMS.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;Your subscription &lt;strong&gt;expired {days} days ago&lt;/strong&gt; (on {dateExpired})&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You are in grace period and &lt;strong&gt;you must renew your subscription in order to continue using your platform.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;A túa subscrición &lt;strong&gt;caducou hai {días} días&lt;/strong&gt; (o {dateExpired})&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Estás en período de carencia e &lt;strong&gt;debes renovar a túa subscrición para seguir usando a túa plataforma.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></target>
