	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Adyen Hosted Payment Pages (HPP) is no longer supported since October 1, 2022. A new solution, called Web Drop-In, is available to continue using the Adyen integration. Configure it in the General Web Drop-In section of this page." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Adyen Hosted Payment Pages (HPP) is no longer supported since October 1, 2022. A new solution, called Web Drop-In, is available to continue using the Adyen integration. Configure it in the General Web Drop-In section of this page.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[As páxinas de pago aloxadas de Adyen (HPP) xa non son compatibles desde o 1 de outubro de 2022. Unha nova solución, chamada Web Drop-In, está dispoñible para seguir usando a integración de Adyen. Configúrao na sección General Web Drop-In desta páxina.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Adyen Information" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Adyen information]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Información de Adyen]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Adyen Payment" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Adyen payment]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Pago Adyen]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Adyen has scheduled the End of Life date for the Hosted Payment Pages (HPP) support on October 1, 2022. A new solution, called Web Drop-In, is available for you to continue using the Adyen integration. Configure it in the General Web Drop-In section of this page" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Adyen has scheduled the end of life date for the Hosted Payment Pages (HPP) support on October 1, 2022. A new solution, called Web Drop-In, is available for you to continue using the Adyen integration. Configure it in the General Web Drop-In section of this page.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Adyen programou a data de fin de vida útil da compatibilidade con páxinas de pago aloxadas (HPP) o 1 de outubro de 2022. Hai dispoñible unha nova solución, chamada Web Drop-In, para que sigas usando a integración de Adyen. Configúrao na sección General Web Drop-In desta páxina.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
