	<trans-unit id="By deleting the selected course(s), you’ll lose all customization and data. Would you like to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[By deleting the selected courses, you will lose all customization and data. Would you like to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao eliminar os cursos seleccionados, perderás toda a personalización e os datos. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By deleting the selected course, you'll lose all customization and data. Please note that if the course is linked to one or more eligibility conditions for the population of automatic groups, it will not be deleted. Would you like to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[By deleting the selected course, you will lose all customization and data. Please note that if the course is linked to one or more eligibility conditions for the population of automatic groups, it will not be deleted. Would you like to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao eliminar o curso seleccionado, perderás toda a personalización e os datos. Teña en conta que se o curso está vinculado a unha ou máis condicións de elixibilidade para a poboación de grupos automáticos, non se eliminará. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By deleting the selected courses, you'll lose all customization and data. Please note that the courses linked to one or more eligibility conditions for the population of automatic groups will not be deleted. Would you like to proceed?" extradata="standard">
