	<trans-unit id="By leaving the Affiliate Price field empty, once you save your changes, the affiliate price will be recalculated automatically according to the default discount set for the content partner. If you want to set a discount different from the default discount, please fill in the field with the new affiliate price." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[By leaving the Affiliate price field empty, once you save your changes, the affiliate price will be recalculated automatically according to the default discount set for the content partner. If you want to set a discount different from the default discount, fill in the field with the new affiliate price.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao deixar o campo Prezo de afiliado baleiro, unha vez que gardes os cambios, o prezo de afiliado volverase calcular automaticamente segundo o desconto predeterminado establecido para o socio de contido. Se queres establecer un desconto diferente ao predeterminado, enche o campo co novo prezo de afiliado.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By putting this course on sale, the Allow Automatic Enrollment When Learners Unenroll option (set in the Catalog tab) will be disabled. Enrollments must be managed manually by Administrators." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[By putting this course on sale, the Allow automatic enrollment when learners unenroll option (set in the Catalog tab) will be disabled. Enrollments must be managed manually by administrators.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao pór este curso á venda, desactivarase a opción Permitir a matrícula automática cando os alumnos dean a matrícula (definida na pestana Catálogo). As inscricións deben ser xestionadas manualmente polos administradores.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By removing an assignment, the domain will be automatically reassigned to the Default Policy and users will be forced to accept it. Are you sure you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[By removing an assignment, the domain will be automatically reassigned to the default policy and users will be forced to accept it. Are you sure you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao eliminar unha asignación, o dominio reasignarase automaticamente á política predeterminada e os usuarios veranse obrigados a aceptala. Estás seguro de que queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By removing an assignment, the domain will be automatically reassigned to the Default Terms &amp; Conditions and users will be forced to accept it. Are you sure you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[By removing an assignment, the domain will be automatically reassigned to the default terms and conditions and users will be forced to accept it. Are you sure you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao eliminar unha asignación, o dominio reasignarase automaticamente aos termos e condicións predeterminados e os usuarios veranse obrigados a aceptalo. Estás seguro de que queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="By resetting the configuration all the links to Salesforce will be removed. All the configurations will be deleted and cannot be recovered, all user data linking the users to Salesforce (SFDC_ID and SFDC_type) will be deleted." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you reset the configuration, the integration between Docebo and Salesforce will be removed, as well as all the synchronized data in Docebo, including the SFDC_ID and SFDC_type additional fields.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se restablece a configuración, eliminarase a integración entre Docebo e Salesforce, así como todos os datos sincronizados en Docebo, incluídos os campos adicionais SFDC_ID e SFDC_type.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
