	<trans-unit id="For example, when you assign a standard price of $100 to a partner course with a setup of a 20% discount, the system will automatically suggest the discounted price for affiliates as $80. Then you will be able to change the affiliates price of each course as desired." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[For example, when you assign a standard price of $100 to a partner course with a setup of a 20% discount, the system will automatically suggest the discounted price for affiliates as $80. Then you will be able to change the affiliates price of each course as desired.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Por exemplo, cando asignas un prezo estándar de 100 $ a un curso para socios cunha configuración dun desconto do 20 %, o sistema suxerirá automaticamente o prezo con desconto para os afiliados en 80 $. Despois poderás modificar o prezo dos afiliados de cada curso segundo o desexes.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
