	<trans-unit id="Honorlock requires your full name, user ID and email address to create an Honorlock account and enable you to access these exam settings. By clicking Allow, this information will be transmitted to Honorlock. For more information on how Honorlock processes your data, please review the {dataPrivacyUrlStart}Honorlock data privacy {dataPrivacyUrlEnd} and security policies." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Honorlock requires your full name, user ID and email address to create an Honorlock account and enable you to access these exam settings. By clicking Allow, this information will be transmitted to Honorlock. For more information on how Honorlock processes your data, please review the {dataPrivacyUrlStart}Honorlock data privacy {dataPrivacyUrlEnd} and security policies.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Honorlock require o teu nome completo, ID de usuario e enderezo de correo electrónico para crear unha conta de Honorlock e permitirche acceder a esta configuración do exame. Ao facer clic en Permitir, esta información transmitirase a Honorlock. Para obter máis información sobre como procesa Honorlock os teus datos, consulta a {dataPrivacyUrlStart}Honorlock de privacidade de datos {dataPrivacyUrlEnd} e as políticas de seguranza.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Honorlock requires your full name, user ID and email address to create an Honorlock account and enable you to access this test session. By clicking Allow, this information will be transmitted to Honorlock. For more information on how Honorlock processes your data, please review the {dataPrivacyUrlStart}Honorlock data privacy {dataPrivacyUrlEnd} and security policies." extradata="standard">
