	<trans-unit id="If not selected, the training material is marked as failed when the minimum score is not met" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If not selected, the training material is marked as failed when the minimum score is not met]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se non se selecciona, o material formativo marcarase como suspenso cando non se acada a puntuación mínima]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If selected, evaluator can complete the evaluation after the due date" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If selected, the evaluator can complete the evaluation after the due date]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se é seleccionado, o avaliador pode completar a avaliación despois da data de vencemento]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If the problem persists, contact the Help Desk." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If the problem persists, contact the help desk.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se o problema persiste, póñase en contacto coa mesa de axuda.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If the search in one or more languages has no results, the page will show the courses available in English." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If the search in one or more languages has no results, the page will show the courses available in English.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se a busca nun ou máis idiomas non ten resultados, a páxina mostrará os cursos dispoñibles en inglés.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If the selected peers go beyond this limit, peers will be randomly selected to meet exactly the limit number." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If the selected peers go beyond this limit, peers will be randomly selected to meet exactly the limit number.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se os compañeiros seleccionados superan este límite, seleccionaranse aleatoriamente para cumprir exactamente o número límite.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If the user is defined as a manager, his/her username, name and surname will be shown in the managers' lists and visible to all users." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If the user is defined as a manager, their username, name and surname will be shown in the managers' lists and visible to all users.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se o usuario se define como xestor, o seu nome de usuario, nome e apelidos aparecerán nas listas de xestores e serán visibles para todos os usuarios.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If this option is activated, users can enroll in any session, course, or learning plan. If this option is not activated, learners can use enrollment links only for the content included in the catalogs they have visibility on." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If this option is activated, users can enroll in any session, course, or learning plan. If this option is not activated, learners can use enrollment links only for the content included in the catalogs they have visibility on.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se esta opción está activada, os usuarios poden inscribirse en calquera sesión, curso ou plan de aprendizaxe. Se esta opción non está activada, os alumnos poden utilizar as ligazóns de inscrición só para o contido incluído nos catálogos nos que teñen visibilidade.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If user already exists, update the user information" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If user already exists, update the user information]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se xa existe un usuario, actualice a información do usuario]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you activate it, the new course page will replace the current course page for all users and for all courses and learning plans." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you activate it, the new course page will replace the current course page for all users and for all courses and learning plans.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se o activas, a nova páxina do curso substituirá á páxina actual do curso para todos os usuarios e para todos os cursos e plans de aprendizaxe.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you already provide us your credit card details you simply need to check" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you have already provided with us your credit card details, you simply need to check]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se xa nos facilitaches os datos da túa tarxeta de crédito, só tes que comprobalo]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you change this preference, some content in catalogs and cart may not be available in the chosen country" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you change this preference, some content in catalogs and cart may not be available in the chosen country]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se cambias esta preferencia, é posible que algúns contidos dos catálogos e do carro non estean dispoñibles no país escollido]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you confirm you want to proceed, the platform will reload to activate the preview mode." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you confirm you want to proceed, the platform will reload to activate the preview mode.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se confirmas que queres continuar, a plataforma volverá cargar para activar o modo de vista previa.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you deactivate the Translate Fields option, the field translation in the languages different from {defaultLanguage} will be lost and overwritten by the {defaultLanguage} translation. Do you want to proceed?\n\nThis operation cannot be undone." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you deactivate the Translate fields option, the field translation in the languages different from {defaultLanguage} will be lost and overwritten by the {defaultLanguage} translation. Do you want to proceed?

This operation cannot be undone.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se desactivas a opción Traducir campos, a tradución do campo nos idiomas diferentes de {defaultLanguage} perderase e sobrescribirase pola tradución {defaultLanguage}. Queres continuar?

Esta operación non se pode desfacer.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete it, users will no longer be automatically enrolled into courses and learning plans when belonging to the selected groups or branches." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete it, users will no longer be automatically enrolled into courses and learning plans when belonging to the selected groups or branches.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se o eliminas, os usuarios deixarán de estar automaticamente inscritos en cursos e plans de aprendizaxe cando pertenzan aos grupos ou ramas seleccionados.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete the selected answer, it will be removed from the platform and you will no longer be able to access it. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete the selected answer, it will be removed from the platform and you will no longer be able to access it. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas a resposta seleccionada, eliminarase da plataforma e xa non poderás acceder a ela. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete the selected area of interest, the platform will remove the content related to the area of interest from the My Areas of Interest channel and you will lose your progress on it. In addition, you will no longer receive updates on the content related to this area of interest." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete the selected area of interest, the platform will remove the content related to the area of interest from the My areas of interest channel and you will lose your progress on it. In addition, you will no longer receive updates on the content related to this area of interest.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas a área de interese seleccionada, a plataforma eliminará o contido relacionado coa área de interese da canle As miñas áreas de interese e perderás o teu progreso nela. Ademais, xa non recibirás actualizacións sobre o contido relacionado con esta área de interese.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete the selected course, you’ll lose the user tracking related to it. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete the selected course, you will lose the user tracking related to it. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas o curso seleccionado, perderás o seguimento de usuarios relacionado con el. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete the selected email sender domain, you will no longer be able to send emails using this domain. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete the selected email sender domain, you will no longer be able to send emails using this domain. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas o dominio do remitente de correo electrónico seleccionado, xa non poderás enviar correos electrónicos utilizando este dominio. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete the selected learning plan, the courses associated with it are not deleted, and the enrolled users are not automatically unenrolled from the courses included in the learning plan." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete the selected learning plan, the courses associated with it are not deleted, and the enrolled users are not automatically unenrolled from the courses included in the learning plan.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se elimina o plan de aprendizaxe seleccionado, os cursos asociados a el non se eliminan e os usuarios inscritos non se cancelan automaticamente dos cursos incluídos no plan de aprendizaxe.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete the selected learning plans, the courses associated with them are not deleted, and the enrolled users are not automatically unenrolled from the courses included in the learning plans." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete the selected learning plans, the courses associated with them are not deleted, and the enrolled users are not automatically unenrolled from the courses included in the learning plans.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se elimina os plans de aprendizaxe seleccionados, os cursos asociados a eles non se eliminan e os usuarios inscritos non se cancelan automaticamente dos cursos incluídos nos plans de aprendizaxe.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete the selected secondary domain, its association with the SSL certificate will be removed. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete the selected secondary domain, its association with the SSL certificate will be removed. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas o dominio secundario seleccionado, eliminarase a súa asociación co certificado SSL. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete the selected skill, the platform will remove the content related to the skill from the My Skills channel and you will lose your progress on it. In addition, you will no longer receive updates on the content related to this skill." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete the selected skill, the platform will remove the content related to the skill from the My skills channel. In addition, you will no longer receive updates on the content related to this skill.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas a habilidade seleccionada, a plataforma eliminará o contido relacionado coa habilidade da canle As miñas habilidades. Ademais, xa non recibirás actualizacións sobre o contido relacionado con esta habilidade.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete this answer, no one will be able to read it. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete this answer, no one will be able to read it. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas esta resposta, ninguén poderá lela. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete this asset, it won't be visible anymore in the channels and by the People you shared it with. This asset will also be removed from your channel page." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete this asset, it will not be visible anymore in the channels and by the people you shared it with. This asset will also be removed from your channel page.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas este recurso, xa non estará visible nas canles e polas persoas coas que o compartiches. Este recurso tamén se eliminará da páxina da túa canle.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete this comment, all replies to it will also disappear. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete this comment, all replies to it will also disappear. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas este comentario, todas as respostas a el tamén desaparecerán. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete this question, all answers to it will also disappear. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
