		<target><![CDATA[Se eliminas esta pregunta, todas as respostas a ela tamén desaparecerán. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete this reply, no one will be able to read it. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
