	<trans-unit id="If you delete training material included in an E-Signature course, the e-signatures of the users who have completed the E-Signature course may lose legal validity." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete training material included in an e-signature course, the e-signatures of the users who have completed the e-signature course may lose legal validity.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se elimina o material formativo incluído nun curso de sinatura electrónica, as sinaturas electrónicas dos usuarios que completaron o curso de sinatura electrónica poden perder validez legal.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you delete training material included in an e-signature course, the e-signatures of the users who have completed the e-signature course may lose legal validity. The platform will record in Audit Trail the changes that have been made. Check the content’s versioning in order not to lose the users’ digital signatures legal validity." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you delete training material included in an e-signature course, the e-signatures of the users who have completed the e-signature course may lose legal validity. The platform will record in audit trail the changes that have been made.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se elimina o material formativo incluído nun curso de sinatura electrónica, as sinaturas electrónicas dos usuarios que completaron o curso de sinatura electrónica poden perder validez legal. A plataforma rexistrará nunha pista de auditoría os cambios realizados.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you disable the visibility of the Enrollment attribute section, the attribute values will be retained and not deleted. If you choose to re-enable this option, the attribute values will be restored for the enrollments they were originally associated with." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you disable the visibility of the Enrollment attribute section, the attribute values will be retained and not deleted. If you choose to re-enable this option, the attribute values will be restored for the enrollments they were originally associated with.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se desactivas a visibilidade da sección de atributos de matrícula, os valores dos atributos conservaranse e non se eliminarán. Se decides volver activar esta opción, os valores dos atributos restauraranse para as inscricións coas que estaban asociados orixinalmente.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you do not assign the same visibility as the source channel, the new channel will be visible to all groups and branches" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you do not assign the same visibility as the source channel, the new channel will be visible to all groups and branches]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se non asignas a mesma visibilidade que a canle de orixe, a nova canle será visible para todos os grupos e ramas]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you don't want to receive these emails," extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you do not want to receive these emails,]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se non queres recibir estes correos electrónicos,]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you edit training material included in an e-signature course, the e-signatures of the users who have completed the e-signature course may lose legal validity. The platform will record in Audit Trail the changes that have been made. Check the content’s versioning in order not to lose the users’ digital signatures legal validity." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you edit or create versions of training material included in an e-signature course, the e-signatures of the users who have completed the e-signature course may lose legal validity. The platform will record in audit trail the changes that have been made.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se editas ou creas versións de material formativo incluído nun curso de sinatura electrónica, as sinaturas electrónicas dos usuarios que completaron o curso de sinatura electrónica poden perder validez legal. A plataforma rexistrará nunha pista de auditoría os cambios realizados.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you have already downloaded {appName}, tap on the icon to open it" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you have already downloaded {appName}, tap on the icon to open it]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se xa descargaches {appName}, toca a icona para abrilo]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you have already started the course in a different language, you may need to restart it, as your progress is linked to the selected language." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you have already started the course in a different language, you may need to restart it, as your progress is linked to the selected language.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se xa comezaches o curso noutro idioma, quizais necesites reinicialo, xa que o teu progreso está ligado ao idioma seleccionado.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you have any problems, contact your administrator." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you have any problems, contact your administrator.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se tes algún problema, ponte en contacto co teu administrador.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you have made changes to the options or eligibility conditions of the group, the membership of the group will be updated accordingly. This process may take some time to complete." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you have made changes to the options or eligibility conditions of the group, the membership of the group will be updated accordingly. This process may take some time to complete.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se fixeches cambios nas opcións ou condicións de elixibilidade do grupo, a pertenza ao grupo actualizarase en consecuencia. Este proceso pode tardar algún tempo en completarse.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you have your password insert your username or your e-mail address in the field below, you will receive a message with the instructions." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you lost your password, insert your username or your email address in the field below. You will receive a message with instructions.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se perdeu o seu contrasinal, insira o seu nome de usuario ou o seu enderezo de correo electrónico no campo seguinte. Recibirás unha mensaxe con instrucións.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you leave now, you will lose the current selection." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you leave now, you will lose the current selection.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se saes agora, perderás a selección actual.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you leave the test, refresh the page, or close the tab, the answers you have given till that moment are automatically submitted and counted as an attempt." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you leave the test, refresh the page, or close the tab, the answers you have given till that moment are automatically submitted and counted as an attempt]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se abandonas a proba, actualizas a páxina ou pechas a pestana, as respostas que deches ata ese momento envíanse automaticamente e cóntanse como un intento.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you leave the test, refresh the page, or close the tab, the answers you have given till that moment are automatically submitted." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you leave the test, refresh the page, or close the tab, the answers you have given till that moment are automatically submitted.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se abandonas a proba, actualizas a páxina ou pechas a pestana, as respostas que deches ata ese momento envíanse automaticamente.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you leave this field blank, the default value ({n}) will be used" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you leave this field blank, the default value ({n}) will be used]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se deixa este campo en branco, empregarase o valor predeterminado ({n}).]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you leave this lesson, you won't be able to see it again." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you leave this lesson, you will not be able to see it again.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se deixas esta lección, non poderás vela de novo.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you leave without saving changes, the system will not unassign the {language_name} language from the course and will not permanently delete the training materials in that language." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you leave without saving changes, the system will not unassign the {language_name} language from the course and will not permanently delete the training materials in that language.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se saes sen gardar os cambios, o sistema non cancelará a asignación do idioma {language_name} do curso e non eliminará permanentemente os materiais formativos nese idioma.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you leave without saving changes, the system will not unassign {count} languages from the course and will not permanently delete the training materials in that language." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you leave without saving changes, the system will not unassign {count} languages from the course and will not permanently delete the training materials in that language.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se saes sen gardar os cambios, o sistema non anulará a asignación de {count} idiomas do curso e non eliminará permanentemente os materiais formativos nese idioma.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you leave without saving changes, the system will not unassign {count} languages from the course and will not permanently delete the training materials in those languages." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you leave without saving changes, the system will not unassign {count} languages from the course and will not permanently delete the training materials in those languages.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se sae sen gardar os cambios, o sistema non anulará a asignación de {count} idiomas do curso e non eliminará permanentemente os materiais formativos neses idiomas.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you leave without saving, you will have {attempts} attempts left." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you leave without saving, you will have {attempts} attempts left.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se marchas sen gardar, quedarás {intentos} intentos.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you like it, then you can activate the new layout for all your users at any time before the official activation date." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you like it, then you can activate the new layout for all your users at any time before the official activation date.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se che gusta, podes activar o novo deseño para todos os teus usuarios en calquera momento antes da data de activación oficial.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you like it, then you can activate the new layout for all your users in advance!" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you like it, then you can activate the new layout for all your users in advance.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se che gusta, podes activar o novo deseño para todos os teus usuarios con antelación.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you proceed to the pre-migration phase you will be able to individually migrate the courses having the Webinar Course Type." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you proceed to the pre-migration phase you will be able to individually migrate the courses having the webinar course type.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se pasas á fase previa á migración poderás migrar individualmente os cursos que teñan o tipo de curso webinar.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you proceed, the course completion status will be reset, and you will have to complete it again to renew the certification: {certification_name}." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you proceed, the course completion status will be reset, and you will have to complete it again to renew the certification: {certification_name}.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se continúas, restablecerase o estado de finalización do curso e terás que completalo de novo para renovar a certificación: {certification_name}.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you proceed, the users enrolled so far will be unenrolled, but those added to the selected groups or branches from now on will still go through the automatic enrollment procedure." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you proceed, the users enrolled so far will be unenrolled, but those added to the selected groups or branches from now on will still go through the automatic enrollment procedure.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se continúa, os usuarios inscritos ata o momento daranse de baixa, pero os que se engaden aos grupos ou ramas seleccionados a partir de agora seguirán pasando polo procedemento de inscrición automática.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you put the course on sale, the settings in the Catalog Options tab will be handled as follows:" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you put the course is on sale, the settings in the Catalog options tab will be handled as follows:]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se pon o curso á venda, a configuración da pestana Opcións do catálogo xestionarase do seguinte xeito:]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you select a folder without selecting its descendants, and the Power User is assigned to a profile with permissions to manage folders, the Power User will be able to create, view and manage subfolders and content within the selected folder" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you select a folder without selecting its descendants, and the Power User is assigned to a profile with permissions to manage folders, the Power User will be able to create, view and manage subfolders and content within the selected folder]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se seleccionas un cartafol sen seleccionar os seus descendentes e o usuario avanzado está asignado a un perfil con permisos para xestionar cartafoles, o usuario avanzado poderá crear, ver e xestionar subcartafoles e contido dentro do cartafol seleccionado.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you select users that are already in the group as automated users, they will be switched to manual. You will be able to manage them manually." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you select users that are already in the group as automated users, they will be switched to manual. You will be able to manage them manually.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se seleccionas usuarios que xa están no grupo como usuarios automatizados, cambiaranse a manual. Poderás xestionalos manualmente.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you take the test again, the current test status will be replaced with the one resulting from the next attempt." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you take the test again, the current test status will be replaced with the one resulting from the next attempt.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se volve facer a proba, o estado actual da proba substituirase polo resultado do seguinte intento.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you take the test again, your current score ({scorePercentage}) will be replaced with the one resulting from the next attempt." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you take the test again, your current score ({scorePercentage}) will be replaced with the one resulting from the next attempt.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se volves facer a proba, a túa puntuación actual ({scorePercentage}) substituirase pola resultante do seguinte intento.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you take the test again, your current score ({score} out of {maxScore}) will be replaced with the one resulting from the next attempt." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you take the test again, your current score ({score} out of {maxScore}) will be replaced with the one resulting from the next attempt.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se volves facer a proba, a túa puntuación actual ({score} de {maxScore}) substituirase pola que resulte do seguinte intento.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you unassign the selected content, you will lose any selection of it in this channel. The action cannot be retrieved. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you unassign the selected content, you will lose any selection of it in this channel. The action cannot be retrieved. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se anulas a asignación do contido seleccionado, perderás calquera selección deste nesta canle. Non se pode recuperar a acción. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you unassign the selected domain from the certificate, the association will be lost. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you unassign the selected domain from the certificate, the association will be lost. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se anulas a asignación do dominio seleccionado do certificado, perderase a asociación. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you unassign the selected domain from the custom SSL certificate, the association will be terminated, and a new certificate managed by the platform will be issued for the domain. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you unassign the selected domain from the custom SSL certificate, the association will be terminated, and a new certificate managed by the platform will be issued for the domain. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se anulas a asignación do dominio seleccionado do certificado SSL personalizado, a asociación finalizará e emitirase un novo certificado xestionado pola plataforma para o dominio. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you unenroll the selected user, the enrollment data will be lost, but the tracking data of the user progress will be kept in the platform. Would you like to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you unenroll the selected user, the enrollment data will be lost, but the tracking data of the user progress will be kept in the platform. Would you like to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se cancelas o rexistro do usuario seleccionado, perderanse os datos de inscrición, pero os datos de seguimento do progreso do usuario manteranse na plataforma. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you unenroll the selected users, their enrollment data will be lost, but the tracking data of their progress will be kept in the platform. Would you like to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you unenroll the selected users, their enrollment data will be lost, but the tracking data of their progress will be kept in the platform. Would you like to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se cancelas o rexistro dos usuarios seleccionados, perderanse os seus datos de inscrición, pero os datos de seguimento do seu progreso manteranse na plataforma. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="If you wish, you can enter a preview mode just for you and check how it looks." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If you wish, you can enter a preview mode just for you and check how it looks.]]></source>
