	<trans-unit id="Learners will enjoy a distraction-free experience, with a maximized course player overlapping the other platform elements when courses are played as part of this learning plan. If played independently, course settings override this configuration." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Learners will enjoy a distraction-free experience, with a maximized course player overlapping the other platform elements when courses are played as part of this learning plan. If played independently, course settings override this configuration.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os alumnos gozarán dunha experiencia sen distraccións, cun reprodutor de curso maximizado que se superpoña cos outros elementos da plataforma cando os cursos se xogan como parte deste plan de aprendizaxe. Se se xoga de forma independente, a configuración do curso anula esta configuración.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Learners will enjoy a distraction-free experience, with a maximized course player overlapping the other platform elements when played independently. If the course is played as part of a learning plan, the plan’s settings override this configuration." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Learners will enjoy a distraction-free experience, with a maximized course player overlapping the other platform elements when played independently. If the course is played as part of a learning plan, the plan’s settings override this configuration.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os alumnos gozarán dunha experiencia sen distraccións, cun reprodutor de curso maximizado que se solapará cos outros elementos da plataforma cando se xoga de forma independente. Se o curso se xoga como parte dun plan de aprendizaxe, a configuración do plan anula esta configuración.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Learners will enjoy a distraction-free experience, with a maximized course player overlapping the other platform elements. Set the default focus mode setting across all courses and learning plans. The player uses the default settings unless they are overridden by customizations in courses and learning plans. Courses assigned to learning plans inherit the plan's settings unless played independently." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Learners will enjoy a distraction-free experience, with a maximized course player overlapping the other platform elements. Set the default focus mode setting across all courses and learning plans. The player uses the default settings unless they are overridden by customizations in courses and learning plans. Courses assigned to learning plans inherit the plan's settings unless played independently.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os alumnos gozarán dunha experiencia sen distraccións, cun reprodutor de curso maximizado que se solapará cos outros elementos da plataforma. Establece a configuración predeterminada do modo de enfoque en todos os cursos e plans de aprendizaxe. O xogador usa a configuración predeterminada a non ser que estean substituídas por personalizacións nos cursos e nos plans de aprendizaxe. Os cursos asignados a plans de aprendizaxe herdan a configuración do plan a non ser que se xoguen de forma independente.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
