	<trans-unit id="Remember to include FULL SCREEN screenshots showing the URL, describe the customer expected behavior, when performing the actions. Also include a quick description of the actions leading to the issue, above all for issues involving users." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[If submitting a product inquiry, please provide as many details as possible. If reporting a bug, please describe the current behavior experienced, as well as the behavior you expect. If possible, provide all steps necessary to replicate the bug. Please remember to capture the full browser window in any screenshot or video supplied to support.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Se envía unha consulta sobre o produto, proporcione tantos detalles como sexa posible. Se informas dun erro, describe o comportamento actual experimentado, así como o comportamento que esperas. Se é posible, proporcione todos os pasos necesarios para replicar o erro. Lembra capturar a xanela completa do navegador en calquera captura de pantalla ou vídeo que se proporcione para o soporte.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
