	<trans-unit id="Set the default course player appearance across all courses and learning plans. The player uses the default settings unless they are overridden by customizations in courses and learning plans. Courses assigned to learning plans inherit the plan's settings unless played independently." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Set the default course player appearance across all courses and learning plans. The player uses the default settings unless they are overridden by customizations in courses and learning plans. Courses assigned to learning plans inherit the plan's settings unless played independently.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Establece o aspecto predeterminado do xogador do curso en todos os cursos e plans de aprendizaxe. O xogador usa a configuración predeterminada a non ser que estean substituídas por personalizacións nos cursos e nos plans de aprendizaxe. Os cursos asignados a plans de aprendizaxe herdan a configuración do plan a non ser que se xoguen de forma independente.]]></target>
