	<trans-unit id="The SCORM package that you're uploading includes Flash content. Flash content is not playable on iOS devices, and it was deprecated on Android devices in 2012. Desktop browsers will deprecate it by 2020. We suggest checking if this SCORM package includes alternative HTML content, or to replace this package with another one that doesn't include any Flash content." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[The SCORM package that you're uploading includes Flash content. Flash content is not playable on iOS devices, and it was deprecated on Android devices in 2012. Desktop browsers will deprecate it by 2020. We suggest checking if this SCORM package includes alternative HTML content, or to replace this package with another one that doesn't include any Flash content.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[O paquete SCORM que estás cargando inclúe contido Flash. O contido Flash non se pode reproducir en dispositivos iOS e quedou en desuso nos dispositivos Android en 2012. Os navegadores de escritorio deixaráno de utilizar en 2020. Suxerímoslle que comprobe se este paquete SCORM inclúe contido HTML alternativo ou que substitúa este paquete por outro que non inclúa contido Flash.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
