	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Use this option if the new version contains only non-structural changes (e.g.: text or image edits)" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Use this option if the new version contains only non-structural changes (e.g.: text or image edits)]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Use esta opción se a nova versión só contén cambios non estruturais (por exemplo, edicións de texto ou imaxes)]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Use this option if you want learners to take the training material once for each course where it is pushed" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Use this option if you want learners to take the training material only once, and not for each course where it is published]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Use esta opción se quere que os alumnos tomen o material formativo só unha vez, e non para cada curso onde se publique]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Use this options if the new version has significant structural changes (e.g.: chapters have been added/removed)" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Use this option if the new version has significant structural changes (e.g.: chapters have been added/removed)]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Use esta opción se a nova versión ten cambios estruturais significativos (por exemplo: engadíronse/elimináronse capítulos)]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Use this preview to review and adjust the group population as needed before activating the group. Ensuring the population is accurate helps avoid triggering unintended enrollments via the associated enrollment rules." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Use this preview to review and adjust the group population as needed before activating the group. Ensuring the population is accurate helps avoid triggering unintended enrollments via the associated enrollment rules.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Use esta vista previa para revisar e axustar a poboación do grupo segundo sexa necesario antes de activar o grupo. Asegurar que a poboación sexa precisa axuda a evitar que se activen inscricións non desexadas a través das regras de inscrición asociadas.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Use this section to identify your activities in the company and to define the areas where you would like improve your knowledge with fresh content coming from the web, prepared for you every day." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Use this section to identify your activities in the company and to define the skills you would like to improve with fresh content coming from the web, prepared for you every day.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Utiliza esta sección para identificar as túas actividades na empresa e definir as habilidades que che gustaría mellorar con contidos frescos procedentes da web, preparados para ti todos os días.]]></target>
