	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users can purchase courses as single entities. When they purchase all of the courses included in the learning plan, the learning plan fixed price is applied." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Users can purchase courses as single entities. When they purchase all of the courses included in the learning plan, the learning plan fixed price is applied.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios poden adquirir cursos como entidades individuais. Cando adquiran todos os cursos incluídos no plan de aprendizaxe, aplícase o prezo fixo do plan de aprendizaxe.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users can rate this course only if they are enrolled" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Users can rate this course only if they are enrolled]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios só poden valorar este curso se están inscritos]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users can rate this course only if they have completed it" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Users can rate this course only if they have completed it]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios só poden valorar este curso se o completaron]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users can see the course but they can be enrolled to this course by Admins only" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Users can see the course but they can be enrolled to this course by Admins only]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios poden ver o curso pero só os administradores poden inscribirse neste curso]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users can self-enroll in the course waiting list, but enrollment requires administrator confirmation. The Enable waiting list option must also be selected to use this feature" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Users can self-enroll in the course waiting list, but enrollment requires administrator confirmation. The Enable waiting list option must also be selected to use this feature]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios poden inscribirse na lista de espera do curso, pero a inscrición require a confirmación do administrador. Tamén se debe seleccionar a opción Activar lista de espera para usar esta función]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users can self-enroll in this course freely, according to the number of available enrollments set with the max quota and the waiting list availability" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Users can self-enroll in this course freely, according to the number of available enrollments set with the max quota and the waiting list availability]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios poden inscribirse neste curso libremente, segundo o número de matrículas dispoñibles fixado coa cota máxima e a dispoñibilidade da lista de espera.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users can self-enroll to this course but Admins have to confirm the enrollment" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Users can self-enroll to this course but Admins have to confirm the enrollment]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios poden inscribirse por si mesmos neste curso pero os administradores teñen que confirmar a inscrición]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users can self-enroll to this course but Admins have to confirm the enrollment. If the max enrollment quota is exceeded, users are placed in waiting list, only if enabled." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Users can self-enroll to this course but Admins have to confirm the enrollment. If the max enrollment quota is exceeded, users are placed in waiting list, only if enabled.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios poden inscribirse por si mesmos neste curso pero os administradores teñen que confirmar a inscrición. Se se supera a cota máxima de inscrición, os usuarios colócanse en lista de espera, só se está habilitado.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users can self-enroll to this course freely. If the maximum enrollment quota is set and reached, they are placed in the course waiting list." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Users can self-enroll to this course freely. If the maximum enrollment quota is set and reached, they are placed in the course waiting list.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios poden inscribirse libremente neste curso. Se se establece e alcanza a cota máxima de matrícula, pasan á lista de espera do curso.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Users cannot upload custom avatars. The platform will display placeholders for new profiles, while existing avatars will remain unchanged." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Users cannot upload custom avatars. The platform will display placeholders for new profiles, while existing avatars will remain unchanged.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios non poden cargar avatares personalizados. A plataforma mostrará marcadores de posición para os novos perfís, mentres que os avatares existentes permanecerán sen cambios.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
