	<trans-unit id="Users included in each one of the groups you selected will be part of the same cohort (one cohort for each group), meaning that users will only be able to see assets, comments and Q&amp;As published by the users assigned to their same group and by platform Superadmins and experts" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Users included in each one of the groups you selected will be part of the same cohort (one cohort for each group), meaning that users will only be able to see assets, comments, and questions and answers published by the users assigned to their same group and by platform Superadmins and experts]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Os usuarios incluídos en cada un dos grupos que seleccionaches formarán parte da mesma cohorte (unha cohorte para cada grupo), o que significa que os usuarios só poderán ver recursos, comentarios e preguntas e respostas publicadas polos usuarios asignados ao seu mesmo grupo e polos superadministradores e expertos da plataforma.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
