	<trans-unit id="When assigning resources to more Power Users at a time, the newly assigned resources will overwrite the previously assigned resources, and Power Users may lose visibility on some of them. Resources assignments won't be overwritten when working with individual Power Users and profiles." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When assigning resources to more Power Users at a time, the newly assigned resources will overwrite the previously assigned resources, and Power Users may lose visibility on some of them. Resources assignments will not be overwritten when working with individual Power Users and profiles.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Ao asignar recursos a máis usuarios avanzados á vez, os novos recursos asignados sobrescribirán os recursos asignados anteriormente e os usuarios avanzados poden perder visibilidade nalgúns deles. As asignacións de recursos non se sobrescribirán cando se traballe con usuarios avanzados e perfís individuais.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When enabled the learner profiles are uploaded from an external system and becomes read-only in the LMS" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When enabled the learner profiles are uploaded from an external system and becomes read-only in the LMS]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando está activado, os perfís do alumno cárganse desde un sistema externo e pasan a ser de só lectura no LMS]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When enabled, training materials are organized into separate folders for each language. Disabling this option will remove all localized training materials from the course." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When enabled, training materials are organized into separate folders for each language. Disabling this option will remove all localized training materials from the course.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando está activado, os materiais de formación organízanse en cartafoles separados para cada idioma. A desactivación desta opción eliminará todos os materiais de formación localizados do curso.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When enabled, users who previously accepted the policy will see the cookie banner again on their next visit whenever an administrator updates the policy." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When enabled, users who previously accepted the policy will see the cookie banner again on their next visit whenever an administrator updates the policy.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando estea activado, os usuarios que aceptaron a política anteriormente verán o banner de cookies de novo na súa próxima visita sempre que un administrador actualice a política.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When learners scan the QR code, their location will be verified to confirm they are at the event venue" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When learners scan the QR code, their location will be verified to confirm they are at the event venue]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando os alumnos escaneen o código QR, verificarase a súa localización para confirmar que están no lugar do evento]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When passing a list of multilanguage codes, a default language must also be passed" extradata="standard">
