		<target><![CDATA[Cando a función multilingüe está activa, tamén se debe pasar o parámetro multilingua_codes.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When the source course is completed, all of the target courses linked to it are also marked as completed, but not vice versa" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When the source course is completed, all the target courses linked to it are also marked as completed, but not vice versa]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando se completa o curso de orixe, todos os cursos de destino vinculados a el tamén se marcan como rematados, pero non viceversa]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When this option is enabled, learners' skill profiles are imported from an external system and become read-only in the platform" extradata="standard">
