	<trans-unit id="When you change the group ownership and save, the new group owner automatically inherits all the users currently populating the group as resources" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When you change the group ownership and save, the new group owner automatically inherits all the users currently populating the group as resources]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando cambias a propiedade do grupo e gardas, o novo propietario do grupo herda automaticamente todos os usuarios que están enchendo o grupo como recursos.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When you change the group ownership and save, the new group owner automatically inherits all the users currently populating the group as resources. If the number of users assigned to the new group owner is higher than the number of users assigned to the previous group owner, the group population is recalculated." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When you change the group ownership and save, the new group owner automatically inherits all the users currently populating the group as resources. If the number of users assigned to the new group owner is higher than the number of users assigned to the previous group owner, the group population is recalculated.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando cambias a propiedade do grupo e gardas, o novo propietario do grupo herda automaticamente todos os usuarios que actualmente enchen o grupo como recursos. Se o número de usuarios asignados ao novo propietario do grupo é superior ao número de usuarios asignados ao anterior propietario do grupo, a poboación do grupo volverá calcularse.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When you close this panel, you will not be able to see this list again" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When you close this panel, you will not be able to see this list again]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando peches este panel, non poderás ver esta lista de novo]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When you delete a Skill, the evaluations’ history for this skill will be deleted too. Do you want to proceed?" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When you delete a skill, the evaluations’ history for this skill will be deleted too. Do you want to proceed?]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando eliminas unha habilidade, tamén se eliminará o historial de avaliacións desta habilidade. Queres continuar?]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When you enter the preview mode of the new course page, you will be the only user able to test the new experience. If you like it, you can activate it for all users." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When you enter the preview mode of the new course page, you will be the only user able to test the new experience. If you like it, you can activate it for all users.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando entres no modo de vista previa da nova páxina do curso, serás o único usuario que poderá probar a nova experiencia. Se che gusta, podes activalo para todos os usuarios.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When you save your changes, the following languages will be unassigned from the course: {languages}. Additionally, any localized training material will be removed, except for those not stored in language folders." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When you save your changes, the following languages will be unassigned from the course: {languages}. Additionally, any localized training material will be removed, except for those not stored in language folders.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando garde os cambios, non se asignarán os seguintes idiomas do curso: {idiomas}. Ademais, eliminarase calquera material de formación localizado, excepto aqueles que non estean almacenados en cartafoles de idiomas.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When you save your changes, the {language} language will be unassigned from the course. Any training material localized in this language will be removed, except for those not stored in language folders." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When you save your changes, the {language} language will be unassigned from the course. Any training material localized in this language will be removed, except for those not stored in language folders.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando garde os cambios, o idioma {language} non será asignado ao curso. Eliminarase calquera material de formación localizado neste idioma, agás os que non estean almacenados en cartafoles de idiomas.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="When you're done symply click the save changes button to apply your preferences." extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[When you are done simply click the Save changes button to apply your preferences.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Cando remates, simplemente fai clic no botón Gardar cambios para aplicar as túas preferencias.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Whether you’ll use Docebo for training your employees, partners or customers, our team would be happy to &lt;strong&gt;custom-tailor a live demo to suit your elearning needs&lt;/strong&gt;. Request an appointment today!" extradata="standard">
		<source><![CDATA[Whether you’ll use Docebo for training your employees, partners or customers, our team would be happy to &lt;strong&gt;custom-tailor a live demo to suit your e-learning needs&lt;/strong&gt;. Request an appointment today!]]></source>
