	<trans-unit id="We are continuously updating your platform to make it accessible, according to the international guidelines on accessibility. These updates may have an impact on your current 7.0 custom CSS if you have one, so we suggest you use this tool to preview and fix it, if needed. The interface preview will be visible to you only." extradata="theme">
		<source><![CDATA[We are continuously updating your platform to make it accessible, according to the international guidelines on accessibility. These updates may have an impact on your current 7.0 custom CSS if you have one, so we suggest you use this tool to preview and fix it, if needed. The interface preview will be visible to you only.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Actualizamos continuamente a túa plataforma para facela accesible, segundo as directrices internacionais sobre accesibilidade. Estas actualizacións poden ter un impacto no teu CSS personalizado actual 7.0 se tes un, polo que suxerímoslle que utilices esta ferramenta para previsualizar e corrixilo, se é necesario. Só ti poderás ver a vista previa da interface.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="While testing, remember that any change you make in your platform - other than editing your custom CSS in this box - will be reflected in your live environment." extradata="theme">
		<source><![CDATA[While testing, remember that any change you make in your platform - other than editing your custom CSS in this box - will be reflected in your live environment.]]></source>
