		<source><![CDATA[Are you sure you want to deactivate the training provider ${event.SiteExternalCode}? It will no longer be possible to use it to schedule new sessions. The sessions already scheduled with the deleted training provider will remain unchanged until a new schedule is synchronized in Docebo.]]></source>
