	<trans-unit id="With more than 600 clients in more than 20 countries, Training Orchestra enables organizations of all sizes to manage training as a business. With specialized solutions for Training Companies, L&amp;D departments, and Extended Enterprise, Training Orchestra's award-winning solution can be deployed in a week in a Docebo environment." extradata="trms">
		<source><![CDATA[With more than 600 clients in more than 20 countries, Training orchestra enables organizations of all sizes to manage training as a business. With specialized solutions for training companies, L&amp;D departments, and extended enterprise, Training orchestra's award-winning solution can be deployed in a week in a Docebo environment.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Con máis de 600 clientes en máis de 20 países, Training Orchestra permite a organizacións de todos os tamaños xestionar a formación como empresa. Con solucións especializadas para empresas de formación, departamentos de L&D e empresas ampliadas, a solución premiada de Training Orchestra pódese implementar nunha semana nun ambiente Docebo.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
