	<trans-unit id="90 Percent Limit Body" extradata="userlimit">
		<source><![CDATA[Greetings from Docebo,&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Things are going well with your Docebo e-learning platform! &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
It looks like the large majority of your active users has already logged in Docebo! &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
As we want to make sure that we keep you posted about  what’s going on in your system, we will notify you again when your  active users cap is reached !&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Please do bear in mind that extra users accessing your Docebo platform will be billed separately at a cost of $4.50 each.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Based on the above, you can consider upgrading your existing users plan, if that makes things convenient for you.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
We appreciate your business, thanks for being a Docebo customer!&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Thanks!&lt;br/&gt;
The Docebo team&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.docebo.com&quot;&gt;www.docebo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;

]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Saúdos de Docebo,&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
As cousas van ben coa túa plataforma de e-learning Docebo! &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Parece que a gran maioría dos teus usuarios activos xa iniciaron sesión en Docebo. &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Como queremos asegurarnos de que te mantemos informado sobre o que está a suceder no teu sistema, notificarémosche de novo cando se alcance o límite de usuarios activos !&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Ten en conta que os usuarios adicionais que accedan á túa plataforma Docebo facturaranse por separado cun custo de 4,50 $ cada un.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
En función do anterior, podes considerar actualizar o teu plan de usuarios existente, se iso fai que as cousas sexan convenientes para ti.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Agradecemos o teu negocio, grazas por ser cliente de Docebo!&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Grazas!&lt;br/&gt;
O equipo Docebo&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.docebo.com&quot;&gt;www.docebo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="&lt;b class='red-text'&gt;In case of reactivation, this plan won't be available&lt;/b&gt; anymore, because now plans start from &lt;b&gt;50 active users.&lt;/b&gt;" extradata="userlimit">
		<source><![CDATA[&lt;b class='red-text'&gt;In case of reactivation, this plan won't be available&lt;/b&gt; anymore, because now plans start from &lt;b&gt;50 active users.&lt;/b&gt;]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[&lt;b class='red-text'&gt;En caso de reactivación, este plan non estará dispoñible&lt;/b&gt; xa, porque agora os plans parten de &lt;b&gt;50 usuarios activos.&lt;/b&gt;]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="&lt;b class='red-text'&gt;Please note that, by cancelling your plan, your data's retention won't be guaranteed.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; If you decide to &lt;b&gt;cancel this plan&lt;/b&gt;, you will be able to subscribe &lt;b&gt;ONLY to plans starting from 50 active users.&lt;/b&gt;" extradata="userlimit">
		<source><![CDATA[&lt;b class='red-text'&gt;Please note that, by canceling your plan, your data's retention won't be guaranteed.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; If you decide to &lt;b&gt;cancel this plan&lt;/b&gt;, you will be able to subscribe &lt;b&gt;ONLY to plans starting from 50 active users.&lt;/b&gt; Otherwise, if you decide to &lt;b&gt;keep this plan&lt;/b&gt;, you'll be able to &lt;b&gt;renew it&lt;/b&gt; forever, until canceled.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[&lt;b class='red-text'&gt;Ten en conta que, ao cancelar o teu plan, non se garantirá a conservación dos teus datos.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt; Se decides &lt;b&gt;cancelar este plan&lt;/b&gt;, poderás subscribirte &lt;b&gt;SÓ a plans a partir de 50 usuarios activos.&lt;/b&gt; En caso contrario, se decide &lt;b&gt;manter este plan&lt;/b&gt;, poderá &lt;b&gt;renovalo&lt;/b&gt; para sempre, ata que se cancele.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
