	<trans-unit id="Unable to schedule Webex Events (classic) after March 31st, 2023. Please update your Webex accounts if you are using an Event or Meeting session type. More information is available here:" extradata="webex">
		<source><![CDATA[Unable to schedule Webex Events (classic) after March 31st, 2023. Please update your Webex accounts if you are using an Event or Meeting session type. More information is available here:]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Non se poden programar eventos de Webex (clásico) despois do 31 de marzo de 2023. Actualiza as túas contas de Webex se estás a usar un tipo de sesión de evento ou reunión. Hai máis información dispoñible aquí:]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
	<trans-unit id="Webex Meeting (classic) will no longer be available in Q1 2024 therefore, any events previously scheduled as Webex Meeting (classic) will, after the new Webex account is authorized, automatically be converted to the Meeting type. Please remember to set the Template field after the account authorization." extradata="webex">
		<source><![CDATA[Webex Meeting (classic) will no longer be available in Q1 2024 therefore, any events previously scheduled as Webex Meeting (classic) will, after the new Webex account is authorized, automatically be converted to the Meeting type. Please remember to set the Template field after the account authorization.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Webex Meeting (clásico) xa non estará dispoñible no primeiro trimestre de 2024, polo tanto, calquera evento programado previamente como Webex Meeting (clásico) converterase automaticamente, despois de que se autorice a nova conta de Webex, ao tipo de reunión. Lembra establecer o campo Modelo despois da autorización da conta.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
