	<trans-unit id="You cannot access the webinar because your account needs to have an email address, first name and last name associated with it. Please fill in the missing information in the Personal info section found in the My profile page. Alternatively, contact your administrator." extradata="zoom-marketplace">
		<source><![CDATA[You cannot access the webinar because your account needs to have an email address, first name and last name associated with it. Please fill in the missing information in the Personal info section found in the My profile page. Alternatively, contact your administrator.]]></source>
		<target><![CDATA[Non podes acceder ao seminario web porque a túa conta debe ter un enderezo de correo electrónico, nome e apelidos asociados. Encha a información que falta na sección Información persoal que se atopa na páxina O meu perfil. Tamén podes contactar co teu administrador.]]></target>
	</trans-unit>
